    // The hard-set: up to N examples per cell.
    "hard": [
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Le ƒe bla nane siwo gbɔna me la, wole mɔ kpɔm be dzoxɔxɔ atso yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ gbɔ le Anyigba ƒe akpa sia akpa kloe, eye tsidzadza ƒe mama dedie le xexeame katã adzi ɖe edzi.[40] Fifia la, Afrika le dzo dam kabakaba wu xexeame ƒe akpa mamlɛa le mamã dedie nu. Anyigbagã la ƒe akpa gãwo ate ŋu ava zu afisi womate ŋu anɔ o le yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedzi kabakaba ta, si akpɔ ŋusẽ gbegblẽ ɖe amegbetɔwo ƒe lãmesẽ, nuɖuɖu ƒe dedienɔnɔ, kple ahedada dzi.[41][42][43] Wole mɔ kpɔm be nutome ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedzi ɖe tsidzadza dzi le teƒe xɔdzowo atrɔ le teƒe xɔdzowo wu eye zi geɖe la, kakaɖedzi menɔa tɔtrɔ ƒe dzesi le teƒe ɖeka ɖesiaɖe ŋu o, togbɔ be wole mɔ kpɔm na tɔtrɔwo hã. Le ɖekawɔwɔ me kple esia la, zi geɖe la, anyigba ƒe dzoxɔxɔ si wokpɔ la dzi ɖe edzi le Afrika tso ƒe alafa 19 lia ƒe nuwuwu vaseɖe ƒe alafa 21 lia ƒe gɔmedzedze abe 1 °C ene, gake le nutoa me la, ede 3 °C na dzoxɔxɔ suetɔ kekeake le Sahel le kuɖiɣia ƒe nuwuwu. Tsidzadza ƒe nɔnɔme siwo wokpɔ ɖee fia be teƒe kple ɣeyiɣi ƒe vovototowo le abe alesi wokpɔ mɔe ene. Tɔtrɔ siwo wokpɔ le dzoxɔxɔ kple tsidzadza me la toa vovo le nuto vovovowo me." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Le kpɔɖeŋu me, Kenya toa yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedziwo bɔbɔe ŋutɔ. Yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe afɔku vevitɔwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye kuɖiɖi kple tsiɖɔɖɔ eye dɔ siwo wɔm wole fifia gblɔ be tsidzadza asẽ wu eye womate ŋu agblɔe ɖi o. Tsɔ kpe ɖe eŋu la, akɔntabubu bubuwo gblɔ be yame ƒe dzoxɔxɔ adzi ɖe edzi 0.5 va ɖo 2 °C.[47] Le dugã me nɔnɔ siwo me amewo sɔ gbɔ ɖo le Nairobi, Kenya la, nɔnɔme siwo me amewo nɔna le ɖoɖo nu alo \"xɔmanyamanyawo\" ate ŋu ana yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ kple afɔku si dona tso afɔku me ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedziwo nagado gã ɖe edzi.[48] Vevietɔ la, zi geɖe la, agbenɔnɔ ƒe nɔnɔme siwo le nuto gã siwo womewɔ le ɖoɖo nu o me hea \"yame ƒe nɔnɔme sue\" si me dzoxɔxɔ le wu vɛ zi geɖe le aƒewo tutunuwo, ya ƒe anyimanɔmanɔ, teƒe damawo ƒe anyimanɔmanɔ, kple elektrikŋusẽ kple dɔwɔna bubuwo ƒe anyimanɔmanɔ ta.[49] Be woaɖe afɔku siwo do ƒome kple yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ dzi akpɔtɔ le nuto siawo siwo womewɔ le ɖoɖo nu o me la, anye vevie be woado nuto siawo ɖe ŋgɔ to dugãwo ƒe ŋgɔyiyi ƒe nudede eme siwo wotu hena yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe nɔnɔme sesẽwo me." },
        { "cell": "degrees", "text": "Savanna ƒe yame ƒe nɔnɔme . Yame ƒe dzoxɔxɔ le mama dedie nu nye 22 °C. Ɣleti si me dzoxɔxɔ le wu enye February, si ƒe dzoxɔxɔ nye 24 °C, eye vuvɔŋɔli wu enye August, si ƒe dzoxɔxɔ nye 19 °C . Tsidzadza ƒe mamã dedie nye milimeta 1,439 ƒe sia ƒe. Ɣleti si me tsi dzana wu enye September, eye tsi dzana milimeta 226, eye esi me tsi dzana wu enye December, eye tsi dzana milimeta 13 ." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Ansre, Gilbert (1961) The Tonal Structure of Ewe. MA Thesis, Kennedy School of Missions of Hartford Seminary Foundation." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Ameka, Felix Kofi (2001) 'Ewe'. In Garry and Rubino (eds.), Fact About the World's Languages: An Encyclopedia of the World's Major Languages, Past and Present, 207-213. New York/Dublin: The H.W. Wilson Company." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Capo, Hounkpati B.C. (1991) A Comparative Phonology of Gbe, Publications in African Languages and Linguistics, 14. Berlin/New York: Foris Publications & Garome, Bénin: Labo Gbe (Int)." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Pasch, Helma (1995) Kurzgrammatik des Ewe Köln: Köppe." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Westermann, Diedrich Hermann (1930) A Study of the Ewe Language London: Oxford University Press." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Wodzi Ephraim le Peki-Avetile le Anyɔnyɔ 13 le ƒe 1899 me. Esi wònye Kuɖagbe wodzii ta woyɔe be Kɔku. Eƒe dzilawo ƒe ŋkɔwo nye Stephen Amuyaa kple Sarah Akoram. Ƞkɔ nyanyɛ si woyɔna na fofoa enye Papa Stefano. Papa Stefano nye aɖaŋuwɔla eye wonye nukpala. Wode mawutsi ta na Ephraim Amu le Ɔktoba 22 lia le ƒe 1899 dzi. Osɔfo Rudolf Mallet enye amesi de mawutsi ta nɛe." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Kɔku Ephraim dze gɔmedzesuku gɔme le Dame le ƒe 1906 me. Eyi Peki Blengo titina suku esime woxɔ ƒe wuieve. Ekpɔ dzidzɔ le hadzidzi kple agblede nusɔsrɔ ŋuti vevie eyata ebia tso woƒe nufiala Karl Ntem si be woafia saŋku ƒoƒo ye. Đoɖo si nɔ eya kple nufiala Ntem dome enye be Ephraim Kɔku ade agble na Aƒetɔ Ntem le Memleɖagbewo ekema nufiala ha͂ afia saŋkuƒoƒoe. Kɔku wu eƒe titina suku nu le ƒe 1915 me eye woxɔ ɖaseɖigbalɛ. Wu esia la, ekpɔ dzidzedze le Abetifi Nufialawoheƒe dodokpɔ si wowɔ la me eyata le Ƒe 1916 ƒe gɔmedzedze le Dzove me la eya kple ehati eve bubu dze mɔ yi Abetifi." },
        { "cell": "digit-run", "text": "Ephraim Kɔku Amu wu eƒe hehe nu le ƒe 1919 me. Abe nufiala yeye la, ele na Amu be woagblɔ Mawunya eye woana kaklanya eƒe nufialawo kple hamea le ehatiwo ƒe ŋkɔ me. Amu tia eƒe mawunya tso Mateo ƒe agbale me. Mateo Ta 25 kpukpui 40. Eƒe nyati na Kwasiɖa Mawunya sia enye, “Aƒetɔ la aɖo miaƒe nugbegblewo teƒe na mi le esi migblee ɖe ɖevi siawo ta”. Egblɔ eƒe mawunya la le Eʋegbe kple Akuapem me." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Anyɔnyɔ 11 - 9/11 de ƒe ade le ɣleti sia me." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Podobský, Jaroslav (1935/1947) Li astres del Verne." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "el-Hadj Bonfoh Abass (/boʊnˈfoʊ ɑːbˈæs/ (odio nuƒola ƒe nɔnɔmetatawo se); 23 November 1948[1] – 29/30 June 2021) nye Togo dunyahela. Enye Togo ƒe Dukplɔla hena ɣeyiɣi aɖe tso February 25, 2005 vaseɖe May 4, 2005. Enye Togo Dukɔa ƒe" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Hope wakio Mwanake (wodzi le ƒe 1988/1989) nye Kenyatɔ asitsala kple dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunyala. Wobunɛ [Amekae?] be enye Afrika sɔhɛ asitsala yeye siwo le ŋgɔ yim la dometɔ ɖeka. Le December 2019 me la, eva zu nyadzɔdzɔwo ƒe tanyawo le agbagba siwo wòdze le aƒewo tutu kple aŋetu siwo wotsɔ ƒu gbe me be yeatsɔ aɖe ɖiƒoƒo plastik ɖa le Kenya." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Nyatakakadzraɖoƒe si nye Rotten Tomatoes si ƒoa ƒu ɖe numetotowo ŋu la ka nya ta be woda asi ɖe edzi 90% kple dzeside 7.30/10 le mama dedie nu, si wotu ɖe ɖeklemiɖela 38 ƒe numetotowo dzi. Nyatakakadzraɖoƒea ƒe ɖeklemiɖelawo ƒe nukpɔsusu ɖeka xlẽ be, \" Beth ɖo kpe edzi be agbe geɖe gakpɔtɔ le Amy Schumer ƒe aɖaŋudɔa me, eye wòƒo adegbe le nukokoedonamela la ƒe nuwɔna si me nu vovovowo le wu vaseɖe fifia ŋu.\" Metacritic, si zãa mamã dedie si woda kpekpeme na, na dzesi 70 le 100 me le ɖeklemiɖela 19 dzi, si fia be \"numetoto siwo nyo le goawo katã me.\"" },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Charis, Olivia (22 September 2022). /blog/2022/09/21/yale-art-alum-showcased-at-yale-center-of-british-art-in-museum-first/\"\". Yale Daily News. Retrieved 27 March 2024." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "United Nations General Assembly Resolution 60/147 lia katã ku ɖe nuwo ɖɔɖɔɖo ne woda le amegbetɔ ƒe gomenɔamesiwo dzi. Eƒo nu tso mɔ siwo dzi woato aɖɔ nusiwo gblẽ si wowɔ ɖo ŋu, abe nusi woxɔ la gbugbɔgaɖo alo nusiwo gblẽ ƒe fexexe nana ene." },
        { "cell": "fractions", "text": "Deha ƒe haƒoƒo, si wogayɔna le Sierra Leone be maringa, nye haƒoƒo ƒe atsyã aɖe si dzɔ le ƒuta nutowo me esime nutoa me haƒolawo dze haƒonu siwo wotsɔna ɖe asi siwo asitsalawo tsɔ vɛ zazã gɔme eye wotsɔe tsaka kple nutoa me ƒe haƒonuwo. Woƒoa ha sia le dehadzraƒe siwo le melidzeƒewo, afi si ƒudzidɔwɔlawo, melidzeƒe dɔwɔlawo, kple nutoa me tɔwo noa aha eye ɖoa to ha sia le. Palm-wine music eventually worked its way inland and a more Africanized version came containing 12/8 polyrhythms; this subgenre would be known as the \"Native Blues\". This style would gain popularity up until World War II when production of the records was stopped." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Debaya Kɔsiɖa enye ŋkeke si kristotɔwo le xexeame godoo ɖuna le Kɔsiɖa si doa ŋgɔ na Easter Kɔsiɖa dzi. Wotsɔna ŋkeke sia ɖoa ŋku nusiwo ŋu woŋlɔnu daɖi le Biblia alo Ŋɔŋlɔ Kɔkɔe la ƒe Nubabla yeye la me. Agbalẽ siwo ƒonu le ŋkeke sia ŋuti wonye Mateo 21:1-11, Marko 11:1-11, Luka 19:28-44 kpakple Yohanes 12:12-19." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Wobunɛ nu vevii be yewoatu yewoƒe dzixɔsewo ɖe Biblia dzi ke menye ɖe amegbetɔ ƒe nukpɔsusu alo hakplɔɖoɖo dzrowo ko dzi o. Wosena le wo ɖokui me abe apostolo Paulo ene esime gbɔgbɔ ʋãe wògblɔ be: “Mawu nye nyateƒetɔ, ke amesiame aʋatsokalae.” (Romatɔwo 3:4, Eʋegbe Biblia*) Le nufiafia siwo wogblɔ be enye Biblia me nyateƒe gome la, Ðasefowo léa nusi Beroiatɔwo wɔ esime apostolo Paulo ɖe gbeƒã na wo la me ɖe asi sesĩe: “Woxɔ nya la kple dzi faa, eye wole ŋɔŋlɔawo me dzrom gbesiagbe be, nusiawo le eme hã.” (Dɔwɔwɔwo 17:11) Yehowa Ðasefowo xɔe se be ele be woatsɔ Ŋɔŋlɔ siwo tso gbɔgbɔ me la ado mawusubɔsubɔ me nufiafiawo katã kpɔ alea, eɖanye woa ŋutɔwo ƒe nufiafia loo alo ame bubu tɔ o. Wokpe wò—wole dzi dem ƒo na wò—be nàwɔ esia le dzeɖoɖo kpli wo me." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Yehowa Ðasefowoa? Ẽ, nenemae woyɔa wo ɖokuii. Enye nɔnɔmefiaŋkɔ si fia be woɖia ɖase le Yehowa, eƒe Mawunyenye, kple eƒe tameɖoɖowo ŋu. “Mawu,” “Aƒetɔ,” kple “Wɔla”—siwo le abe “Dukplɔla,” “Fia,” kple “Aʋafia” ene—nye dzesideŋkɔwo eye woate ŋu azã wo na ame vovovo geɖe. Gake “Yehowa” ya nye ŋkɔ tɔxɛ eye Mawu ŋusẽkatãtɔ kple xexeme Wɔla lae wozãnɛ na. Woɖe esia fia le Psalmo 83:19 be: “Ne woadze sii be, ŋkɔwòe nye YEHOWA, eye wò ɖeɖe koe ɖo kpo ɖe anyigba blibo la dzi!”" },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Ŋɔŋlɔawo me nya si me Yehowa Ðasefowo ɖe woƒe ŋkɔ tsoe la le Yesaya ta 43 lia. Le afima la, woɖɔ xexeame ƒe nɔnɔme abe nusi le edzi yim le ʋɔnudrɔ̃ƒe ene: Wogblɔ na dukɔwo ƒe mawuwo be woakplɔ woƒe ɖasefowo vɛ ne woava ɖo kpe edzi ne woƒe nya dzɔ alo be woase ɖasefo siwo le Yehowa ƒe akpa dzi ƒe nya ale be woalɔ̃ ɖe nyateƒea dzi. Afimae Yehowa gblɔ na eƒe amewo le be: “Miawoe nye nye ɖasefowo kple nye dɔla, si metia, ne mianyae, miaxɔ dzinye ase, eye miadze sii be, nyee. Womewɔ mawu aɖeke do ŋgɔ nam o, eye ɖeke mado megbe nam o. Nyee nye Yehowa, eye xɔnametɔ aɖeke meli kpe ɖe ŋunye o.”—Yesaya 43:10, 11." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Ðasefowo nɔ Yehowa Mawu si le anyigba dzi ƒe akpe geɖe hafi wova dzi Yesu. Esi Hebritɔwo ta 11 yɔ xɔsetɔ siawo dometɔ aɖewo ƒe ŋkɔ vɔ la, Hebritɔwo 12:1 gblɔ be: “Eyata míawo hã, esi ɖaseɖilawo ƒe alilikpo gã ŋutɔ ƒo xlã mí la, mina míaɖe nu kpekpe sia nu kpekpe kple nuvɔ̃, si ɖea to ɖe mí la ɖa, eye mina míatsɔ dzidodo anɔ dudimekeke, si woɖo na mí la dzi.” Yesu gblɔ le Pontio Pilato ŋkume be: “Esia ta wodzim ɖo, eye esia ta meva xexeame ɖo, bena maɖi ɖase na nyateƒe la.” Woyɔe be “ɖaseɖila nuteƒewɔla kple nyateƒetɔ.” (Yohanes 18:37; Nyaɖeɖefia 3:14) Yesu gblɔ na eƒe nusrɔ̃lawo be: “Miaxɔ [gbɔgbɔ] kɔkɔe, si le mia dzi va ge la, ƒe ŋusẽ, eye mianye nye ɖaseɖilawo le Yerusalem kple Yudea katã kple Samaria, eye vaseɖe anyigba ƒe seƒe ke.”—Dɔwɔwɔwo 1:8." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Biblia gblɔ be Tarax dzi viŋutsu etɔ̃. Yawo enye Abram, Naxor kple Xaran. Le Mose I ta 20:12 me la, Sara, si nye Abraham srɔ̃ nye nɔvia hã, elabena woameve nye Terax viwo gake wo nɔwo to vovo. Wo de enye Ur le Kaldea nyigba dzi. Tarax vi Xaran tre kuku na tɔa le Ur. Xaran dzi Lot hafi wò ku. Naxor tso aƒe ɖe Xaran, si le Ur mɔ dzi. Tarax ʋu tso Ur kple via Abraham kple eƒe tɔgbeyɔviŋutsu Lot. Woƒe ɖoɖo enye be yewoayi Kanaan gake wodze Xaran eye Terax ku le afima. Le eƒe ku megbe la, Abram kple eƒe ƒometɔwo ʋu tso Xaran. Biblia gblɔ bena Tarax nye trɔ̃subɔɔla." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Mahama ɖu dzi le December 2012 ƒe akɔdada me kple 50.70% . Esi woɖoe zi dzi la, tsitretsiɖeŋula New Patriotic Party si Nana Akufo-Addo, Mahamudu Bawumia, si nye eƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ kple Jacob Otanka Obetsebi-Lamptey, si nye habɔbɔa ƒe zimenɔla, nɔ ŋgɔ na la tsɔ nya ɖe nyatia me tsonuwo ŋu hegblɔ be womewɔe ɖe ɖoɖo nu o eye wowɔ nu gbegblẽwo. Ghana Ʋɔnudrɔ̃ƒe Kɔkɔtɔ ƒe ʋɔnudrɔ̃la enyi ye drɔ̃ nya sia. Le nyadɔdrɔ̃ ɣleti enyi megbe la, Ʋɔnudrɔ̃ƒea le Dasiamime 29, 2013 dzi, tsɔ ame akpa gãtɔ ƒe nukpɔsusu gbe nyaa ." },
        { "cell": "clock", "text": "Mitsinyedɔ ŋutinyawo abet so billion 1.7 yi 5&nbsp; dzɔna le ƒe ɖesiaɖe me. Ebɔwu le dukɔ siwo mede ŋugɔ o me, afisiwo ɖeviwo lea dɔa le abe zi etɔ̃ ene le ƒe me. Vaseɖe 2012 la, eyae nye bɔbɔtɔ evelia le ɖeviwo ƒe ku hehe vee me le ɖevi maxɔƒeatɔwo dome le xeaxeame godoo (0.76 million or 11%). Mitsinyedɔ ƒe amelele hea malnutrition ve eye wowɔa esia le ɖevimaxɔƒeatɔ̃wo dome. Kuxe bubu siwo ateŋu va la enye lame kple susu ƒe matsimatsi." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Xe siawo srɔ̃a amegbetɔwo ƒe nuƒoƒo alebe ne egblɔ nya aɖe le wogbɔ la, woagbugbɔe agblɔ nya ma na wò ha͂. Nusrɔ̃la aɖewo fia be ako aɖewo sena egbegbɔgblɔ aɖewo gɔme. Ako eve siwo ŋkɔwo enye Alex kpaple N'kisi la, wonye ako tɔxewo. Alex srɔ̃ nuwo ƒe ŋkɔwo eye eteaŋu xlẽa nuwo ƒe gbɔsɔsɔ eye wòƒoa nu le nuwo ŋuti. N'kisi hã srɔ̃ nyawo abe akpe ɖeka sɔŋ, eye wòteaŋu zãa nya siawo pɛpɛpɛ hã.== Akowo kple amegbetɔwo ==" },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Wodze ga yeyea ŋdɔ wɔwɔm le Ghana. Woawɔ Ghanaian cedi yeyea kple ga xoxoa katã ŋudɔ vaseɖe Dzome 2007 hafi woaɖe asi le xoxoa ŋu susue. Wogbaa GH¢&nbsp;1 yeyea na 10,000 cedi xoxoawo." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Le Batu ƒe Europa dzi dzedze le ƒe 1240 me megbe la, Alexander Nevsky, si nye dziehenyigbawo ƒe fiavi, va zu Batu ƒe viŋutsu si wòxɔ nyi, eye nubabla aɖe si wowɔ kple Horde la na viaŋutsu Daniil si xɔ ƒe 16 la va zu Muscovitɔwo ƒe fiavi gbãtɔ, si nye egbegbe Russia ƒe gɔmedzedze. Titinaɣeyiɣiwo me du vevi bubu si le egbegbe Russia enye Veliky Novgorod, si tsi tre ɖe Moscow ŋu zi geɖe eye ƒe 1478 me koe woɖu edzi. Emegbe Ukraine kple Belarus klã tso Russia si ava va gbɔ le ƒe alafa 14 lia me eye wova zu Lithuania Fiaɖuƒe Gã la ƒe akpa aɖe (vaseɖe ƒe alafa 18 lia me la, nuto eveawo te ɖe wo nɔewo ŋu ŋutɔ, eye egbea gɔ̃ hã la, Ukraine kple Belarus ƒe nyagbɔgblɔ ɖeka ƒe 84% le wo dome). Sikaha la wu eƒe anyinɔnɔ nu le ƒe alafa 15 lia me, eye woma ɖe Crimea, Astrakhan, Kazan, kple Rus’ fiaɖuƒewo me, siwo wɔ aʋa sesẽ geɖe, siwo dome Lithuania Fiaɖuƒe Gã la hã nɔ. Zi geɖe la, aʋawɔwɔawo yia edzi ƒo xlã Smolensk-dugã la. Russiatɔwo dzɔ tso Ɣedzeƒe Slav towo me eye wova zu dukɔ si to vovo le Muscovitɔwo te le ƒe alafa 16 lia me ." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Spaintɔwo ƒe aʋadziɖulawo va ɖo le ƒe 1524 me, eye le ƒe 1537 me la, woɖo Asunción dugã, si nye Río de la Plata Nutome ƒe fiadu gbãtɔ. Le ƒe alafa 17 lia me la, Paraguay nye Yesutɔwo ƒe mawunyadɔgbedelawo ƒe titina, afisi wotrɔ Guaranítɔ siwo nye afimatɔwo wozu Kristotɔwo le eye wova nya Europatɔwo ƒe dekɔnuwo le. Esi wonya Yesutɔwo le Spaintɔwo ƒe anyigbamamawo me le ƒe 1767 me vɔ la, Paraguay va zu nuto si le gota geɖe wu. Esi Paraguay xɔ ɖokuisinɔnɔ tso Spain le ƒe alafa 19 lia ƒe gɔmedzedze megbe la, ŋutasẽdziɖuɖu vovovowoe ɖu dzi. Ɣeyiɣi sia wu enu kple Paraguay-ʋa si me afɔku le (ƒe 1864–1870), si me dukɔa bu eƒe amewo ƒe afã do ŋgɔ na aʋawɔwɔ kple eƒe anyigba ƒe 25–33% lɔƒo. Le ƒe alafa 20 lia me la, Paraguay gadze ŋgɔ dukɔwo dome aʋawɔwɔ gã bubu—si nye Chaco-ʋa (ƒe 1932–1935) si wowɔ kple Bolivia—si me Paraguay ɖu dzi le. Dukɔa va nɔ asrafowo ƒe ŋutasẽdziɖula siwo kplɔ wo nɔewo ɖo te, eye wòwu enu kple Alfredo Stroessner ƒe ƒe 35 ƒe dziɖuɖu, si nɔ anyi vaseɖe esime womue le ƒe 1989 me to asrafowo ƒe amedzidzedze le ememe me. Esiae nye Paraguay ƒe demokrasi ƒe ɣeyiɣi si li fifia ƒe gɔmedzedze." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Togbɔ be dukɔ eve siwo me ƒu mele o siwo le Anyiehe Amerika dometɔ ɖekae nye (Bolivia ye nye evelia) hã la, melidzeƒewo le Paraguay le Paraguay kple Paraná tɔsisiwo dzi siwo naa wo doa go yia Atlantik-ƒua me, to Paraná-Paraguay Tsimɔa dzi. Paraguaytɔ miliɔn 6 ƒe akpa gãtɔ nye mestizo, eye Guarani dekɔnuwo gakpɔtɔ le ŋusẽ kpɔm ɖe amewo dzi le afisiafi; ame siwo wu 90% doa Guaranigbea ƒe gbetagbe vovovowo kpe ɖe Spaingbe ŋu. Paraguay ƒe GDP na ame ɖeka ƒe PPP nye adrelia le South America. Le ƒe 2017 ƒe Nuteƒekpɔkpɔ Nyuiwo ƒe Numekuku si wotu ɖe xexeame katã ƒe numekuku ŋuti nyatakakawo dzi me la, Paraguay xɔ nɔƒe si nye \"xexeame ƒe teƒe si dzidzɔ le wu\"." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Mahama di be yeaxɔ zimenɔɣi blibo evelia le Dzome 2016 ƒe akɔdadame. Nana Akufo-Addo ɖu edzi . Mahama xɔ akɔdadawo ƒe 44.4% tsɔ sɔ kple Akufo-Addo ƒe 53.5%. Mahama gaʋli ho le dukɔa ƒe tiatiawɔblɔɖe me abe NDC ƒe aflagatsɔla le ƒe 2020 me gake Nana Addo gadu edzi." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Hepatitis A (si woyɔna tsa be infectious hepatitis) nye dɔlekui si nu se na akla tsona hepatitis A virus gbɔ (HAV). Dɔa lele geɖe mefia dzesi boo aɖeke o vevietɔ le amesiwo metsi o la me. Ɣeyiɣi tso dɔa ƒe gɔmedzedze yi eƒe dzesiwo gbɔ le ame siwo lenɛ me la le abe kɔsiɖa eve yi ade. Ne dzesiwo dze la wonɔa anyi zi geɖe abe kɔsiɖa enyi esiwo nye: trutsɔame, trutru, afɔdzidedɔ, ŋutigbale ƒe fufuu, fever kple aŋɔmeɖuame. Ame geɖewo abe 10–15% gakpɔa dzesiwo ƒe vava le dzinu ade tso dɔa lele zi gbatɔ megbe. Akla ƒe gbegble kpata teaŋu dzɔna ɣeaɖewoyi vevietɔ le ametsitsiwo me." },
        { "cell": "signs", "text": "Le xexeame godoo la abe milion 1.5 ƒe dɔlelea ƒe dzesi dzena ƒe sia ƒe eye million akpewo nye dɔa lelawo le wo katã me. Ebɔ wu le xexeame ƒe akpa siwo medza o eye tsinono nyui hã mesu amewo o. Le dukɔ siwo mede ŋugɔ o wome la ɖeviwo si de 90% la le dɔa hafi xɔna ƒe 10 eyata womegalene le tsitsi me o. Edzɔna kpata le dukɔ siwo de ŋgɔ vie la me ne ɖeviwo melee hafi tsi o eye abidodo godoo hã mebɔ o. Le 2010 me la, hepatitis A sesẽ ƒe dodo zu ame 102,000 ku. Xexeame godoo ƒe Hepatisis Ŋukeke vana ƒe sia ƒe le July ƒe ŋkeke 28 dzi be woahe nufiamenyawo tso 'viral' hepatitis ŋu." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Tso Yanuar gbatɔ 1920 la , Amu dze dɔ gɔme abe nufiala le Peki Blengo E.P. Titina suku me. Esi hadzidzi doa dzidzɔ nɛ ta la eɖoe kplikpa be yea fia ha sukuviawo ale be woate ŋu aŋlɔ eye woadzi ha ɖe ɖoɖo alo noti nu. Le esia wɔwɔ me la, eyi Koforidua ɖaƒle kasaŋku adodoe si woyɔna be Henry Riley saŋku. Ede saŋku sia ʋu vaɖo Frankadua gake ele nɛ be woatsɔ saŋku sia ɖe ta tso Frankadua va ɖo Peki. Ke esia mesese na Kɔku Amu kura o. Eya kple mɔzɔla ɖeka si woyɔna be Aƒetɔ Lo la wɔ mɔzɔzɔ sia zã blibo la katã eye Amu ɖo Peki le fɔŋli kple saŋku la le eƒe ta." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Le Masa 16, 1979 dzi la, wowu Ignatius Kutu Acheampong si nye Ghana dukplɔla tso 1972 va ɖo 1978, kple E. K. Utuka si nye Ghana liƒoŋudzɔsrafowo ƒe amegã. Wotso afia nawo be woɖu dukɔa ƒe ga zã eye womenye nuteƒewɔlawo o. Le Masa 26, 1979 dzi la, woga wu asrafomegãwo woame ade kpe ɖe eve siawo ŋu. Eva dze le National Reconciliation Commission ƒe nyawometoto me be ʋɔnudɔdrɔ siawo me de tutuwo eye wome drɔ ʋɔnu na wodometɔ aɖewo kroa o." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Le 1945 me la, Nkrumah gbɔ va Ghana. Le eƒe gbɔgbɔ ko la, woɖoe nuŋlɔ̃la na United Gold Coast Convention (UGCC). Woƒe nunɔla ɣemaɣi enye J. B. Danquah. Le ƒe ʋea ɖewo megbe la, vovototo va ge ɖe wome eye Nkrumah do le UGCC la me eye wò va ɖo eya ŋutɔ ƒe dunyaheha si nye Convention People's Party (CPP). Wo nɔ United Kingdom dukɔa biam na Ghana ƒe ɖokuisinɔnɔ." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "J.N.D. Kelly: Early Christian Creeds. 3rd edition. Longman, Harlow 1975, ISBN 0-582-49219-X (Eŋlisigbe)" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "Presbyteria Nyanyui Hame le Ghana enye Kristo subɔsubɔ hame ɖeka le Ghana. Amegeɖe ga yɔnae be \"E.P. Church\" elabena eƒe ŋkɔ le Eŋlisigbe me enye Evangelical Presbyterian Church." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "United Reformed Church - Osɔfo ɖeka tsoa E. P. Hamea alo Presbyterian Church of Ghana vayi wɔa dɔ kpli wo ƒe ene sia ene." },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "E. P. Hamea de ha kple Kristo habɔbɔwo le xexeame godoo. Wodemtɔao ɖewo wonye:" },
        { "cell": "dotted", "text": "B.P. Ŋkeke (Skout Habɔbɔ Canada) (Dzodze 22)" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Anyikpe alo mud-brick nye brik si wotsɔ ya ƒua gbe, si wotsɔ aŋɔ, anyigbaʋuʋu, ke kple tsi tsakaa nu abe bli ƒe aŋgba alo gbe ene wɔe. Wonya anyikpewo tso ƒe 9000 D.M.Ŋ., togbɔ be tso ƒe 4000 D.M.Ŋ." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Wotsɔ anyikpewo tu Yerixo ƒe aƒewo le ƒe 9000 D.M.Ŋ. me. Kpeɖodziwo ɖee fia be anyikpe ƒe wɔwɔme si le Tel Tsaf la nɔ anyi ƒe 500 ya teti, le Xalkolith ƒe titinaɣeyiɣia katã me." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Anyiehe Asiatɔwo le Mehrgarh tu xɔ siwo wotsɔ anyikpe tu henɔ wo me le ƒe 7000–3300 D.M.Ŋ. me. Wozã anyikpe siwo wotsɔ anyigba wɔe le teƒe siwo wu 15 le ƒe akpe etɔ̃lia D.M.Ŋ. me. Le Harappan Tsitsi ƒe ɣeyiɣia me la, wozãa anyikpe siwo wotsɔ dzo wɔe." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Le Minoa Kreta, le Knossos teƒea la, blematomenukulawo ƒe kpeɖodziwo fia be wozãa anyikpe siwo wotsɔ ŋdɔ ƒu wɔe le Kpe Gbadzaɣi me (do ŋgɔ na ƒe 3400 D.M.Ŋ.)." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Wodzi Cronius le ƒe 285 A.D. lɔƒo. Enɔ saɖagaxɔ aɖe me zi gbãtɔ. Emegbe la, edzo le saɖagaxɔa me va subɔ abe Helagbe me gbegɔmeɖela ene na Anthony Gãtɔ. Emegbe la, Cronius va zu sekewɔla kple nunɔla le Nitria. Eƒe nusrɔ̃lawo dometɔ aɖewoe nye Isak si tso Lãmenugbagbeviwo me. Eku le ƒe 386 A.D lɔƒo." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Le ƒe 2014 me la, Amerika nyadzɔdzɔŋlɔla Ta-Nehisi Coates ta nyati ɖedzesi aɖe si ƒe tanyae nye \"Nya si Woatsɔ Axe Fe na Ame.\" Nyati sia ƒo nu tso kluvinyenye kple Jim Crow ƒe sewo ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedzi siwo yi edzi ŋu eye wogbugbɔ yɔyɔ be woaxe fe ɖe eta. Coates te gbe ɖe Sewɔtakpekpea ƒe kpododonu enuenu be wòada asi ɖe Rep. John Conyers Jr. ƒe H.R.40 Sewɔtakpekpea dzi dzi koŋ be enye dzesi be womelɔ̃ be yewoaɖɔ nu madzɔmadzɔ siwo wowɔ va yi ɖo o." },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "Le September 2016 me la, Dukɔ Ƒoƒuawo ƒe Dɔwɔha si Kpɔa Ame Siwo Tso Afrika Ŋuti Nyawo Gbɔ de dzi ƒo na U.S. Sewɔtakpekpea be woada asi ɖe H.R.40 dzi be woasrɔ̃ nu tso nusiwo woatsɔ axe fe ɖe eta ƒe aɖaŋuɖoɖowo ŋu. Togbɔ be womeda asi ɖe aɖaŋuɖoɖo aɖeke koŋ dzi o hã la, woƒe nyatakakaa de dzesii be ameƒomevinyenye ƒe tasɔsɔmasɔ gakpɔtɔ le United States. Woɖe eme be togbɔ be tɔtrɔwo va tso Jim Crow ƒe ɣeyiɣia kple Dukɔmeviwo ƒe Gomenɔamesiwo Ŋuti Habɔbɔa me hã la, \"nukpɔsusu si kpɔa egbɔ be ƒuƒoƒo aɖe ɖu bubu dzi la yi edzi le ŋusẽ gbegblẽ kpɔm ɖe Afrika-Amerikatɔwo ƒe dukɔmeviwo, dunyahehe, ganyawo, hadome kple dekɔnuwo ƒe gomenɔamesiwo dzi egbea.\" Nyatakakaa gblɔ hã be “ameƒomevinyenye ƒe vovototodedeameme si le ɖoɖo nu ƒe nukpɔsusu si me afɔku le xea mɔ na hadome ɖekawɔwɔ le United States dukɔmeviwo dome.”" },
        { "cell": "era-marker", "text": "BLM xɔ dukɔa ƒe susu le ƒe 2014 me to ablɔdzi tsitretsiɖeŋuwo me. Ðeɖefia siawo kplɔ Afrika-Amerikatɔ eve bubuwo ƒe ku ɖo: Michael Brown le Ferguson, Missouri (si na ame geɖe tsi tre ɖe eŋu), kple Eric Garner le New York City. Tso esime Ferguson tsi tre ɖe eŋu la, BLM ƒe ʋiʋlilawo yi edzi le tsitre tsim ɖe Afrika-Amerikatɔ bubu geɖe ƒe ku ŋu le kpovitɔwo ƒe nuwɔnawo me alo esime wonɔ kpovitɔwo ƒe gaxɔ me. Le ƒe 2015 ƒe dzomeŋɔli la, BLM ƒe ʋiʋlilawo hã va ƒo wo ɖokui ɖe ƒe 2016 U.S. dukplɔla ƒe tiatia me." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Le ƒe 1926 me la wo do Amu ɖe ŋgɔ eyata wohiã be woaɖee yi Akrɔpɔŋ nufialawo teƒe abe nufiala ene. Le afisia la ame geɖewo kpɔ Tata Amu ƒe nuwɔna abe movinu. Abe nufiala si kpɔa agbledenyawo dzii la, ebia tso sukuviwo si be woatsɔ afɔdzi ado nukuwo abe nunyronu gake esia medze nusrɔlawo ŋu o, elabe wobui be mele na agbalɛnyala be woade asi mi ŋuti o. Ke amu ŋutɔ fia kpɔɖeŋu wo. Eya ŋutɔ lɔa mi la yina ɖe agble la me hedoa nukuawo. Togbɔ be sukuviawo lia liʋiliʋi ha͂ la wokplɔnɛ ɖo le dɔa wɔwɔ me." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Amu xɔ ɖe ameyibɔ nuwɔwɔ dzi ale gbegbe be eƒe tsinonu kekeake ha nye tre. Esrɔ Akuapemgbe akuaku tso eƒe hadzihamenɔlawo gbɔ. Tso 1927 la, Tata Amu ɖoe kplikpa be ameyibɔwudodowo koe anye yeƒe nudodo. Eɖoe be yemaga do yevuwu titri siwo na wodzea fifia la le ameyibɔ nyigba dzi o." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Le ƒe 1931 le esi Tata Amu gblɔ mawunya le eƒe ameyibɔvɔ me megbe la, woyɔe ɖe hamea ƒe akametiwo ŋgɔ eye Osɔfoga Peter Hall ka mo nɛ gblɔ be yewomexɔe se be ata avɔ agblɔ mawunya le gbedoxɔ me o eye yewoxɔe se ha͂ be magawɔe akpɔ gbeɖe o. Tso gbemagbe dzi la, Kɔku Amu ɖe adzɔgbe na eɖokui be anyo be yeanye nufiala kple saŋkuƒola le hamea me wu be yeazu Mawunyagblɔla si ado yevuwu manyatanuawo le Afrika dzoxɔxɔ sia me. Evɔ la, Amu ƒe didi veviewo dometɔ ɖeka enye be yeazu Osɔfo hafi." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Tata Amu ɖe srɔ̃ le Masa1942 me. Eɖe Aƒenɔvi Beatrice Yao tso Peki Blengo. Tata Amu kpa atiɖaka adodoe aɖe na srɔ̃a ɖe yevugaɖaka teƒe. Tata Amu xɔ ƒe blaene-vɔ-etɔ hafi ɖe srɔ. Le Tedoxe 27 lia 1965 le Memleɖa aɖe gbe la Legon Yunivɛsiti na akɔtadzesi kple ɖaseɖigbalɛ kɔkɔtɔ Đɔkita le hakpakpaɖaŋu me Tata Amu." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Wodzi Yaa Asantewaa (1840 - Kele 7, 1921) le Besease le Asante nutome. Yaa Asantewaa ɖe aƒetɔ Nana Owusu Kwabena eye wodzi vinyɔnuvi ɖeka si nye Ama Seerwah Brekatu ko, Yaa Asantewaa nɔ Besease hetsi hafi ʋu yi Boankra be woakpɔ eƒe agblewo dzi eye woaga keke wo ɖe dzi ha." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Esi Iŋlis-yevuwo le mamayɔvia, Afrane Kuma le ƒe 1896 me la Yaa Asantewaa ɖu dzi abe fianyɔnu kple Dufia ŋutsu. Yaa Asantewaa ho aʋa ɖe Inŋlisyevuwo ŋu le ƒe 1900 esi Mɔmefia Hodgson di vevie be yeaxɔ Asantefia ƒe sikazikpui. Ke nu bubu siwo na Asanteawo ho aʋa vevie sia wo enye" },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Hafi Yaa Asantewaa kple Asanteawo na ho aʋa la, Nyɔnufia Yaa Asantewaa kpe kple fiawo le Tedoxe 28lia le 1900 ƒe zatiƒe eye wonyi dzo . Aʋa sia tso dziku si wodo na Asanteawo to Hodgson ƒe biabia be woatsɔ Asanteawo ƒe fiazikpuiga si wofa sika la na Iŋlisiawo ta." },
        { "cell": "year", "text": "Iŋlis yevuwo ƒe aʋalɔgo si aʋafia ST Hill, Lt. Aspinall, kple Major Manta-naro kplɔ la kpe aʋa kple Asanteawo le Anyɔnyɔ 30lia le ƒe 1900me. Esi yevuawo si Asanteawo la woga trɔ yi Kumasi. Esi yevuawo di vevie be ye woa le fia tsitretsilawo ta la, wona mɔnukpɔkpɔ fia siwo he wo ɖokuiwo ɖe go la be woakpɔ ablɔɖe tohe aɖeke manɔmee. Yevuawo na adzɔga pɔnde 600 be amesiame si ate ŋu le fia siwo ho aʋa dometɔ aɖe la akpɔ gome tso ga home sia me. Esia wɔe be wote ŋu le Asantefia gede siwo ho aʋa ɖe Iŋlisiawo ŋu la." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Eʋeviwo, wo kata͂ tso Nɔtse alo ŋɔ͂tsɛ dua me. Woƒe fia si nɔ dziɖum la ŋkoe nye Tɔgbe Agɔkɔli. Wotɔ gli-kpɔ ga aɖe ƒoxla Nɔtse du blibo la kata. Alesi fia la nye ŋutasela ta la, dumeviawo kata ɖoe kplikpa be ye woasi adzo le fia la gbɔ. Le esiata la, wo ɖoe na nyɔnuwo be woa nɔ tsi ƒom ɖe gli-kpɔ la ŋu ɣesiaɣi si woanyanu alo aklɔ agbame. Esia yi edzi vaseɖe esime gli-kpɔ la gba eye Eʋeawo to gli-kpɔ gbagba la me si le fia vɔɖi Tɔgbe Agɔkɔli gbɔ yi ɖe Ghana, Benin kple Togo ƒe teƒe bubuwo. Le fifia me la, Eʋeawo anɔ abe ame \"2,000,000 ene\"." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Sweden (Sverige) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Sweden do liƒo kple Denmark, Finland kpakple Norway. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 9,000,000 lɔƒo. Sweden ƒe dugã enye Stockholm." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Dzamanya (Deutschland) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 82,000,000 lɔƒo (2015). Dzamanya do liƒo kple Denmark, Netherlands, Belgium, Luxembourg, France, Switzerland, Austria, Czechia kpakple Poland. Dzamanya ƒe dugã enye Berlin." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Norway (Norge) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Norway do liƒo kple Finland, Russia kpakple Sweden. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 5,627,400 lɔƒo (2026) . Norway ƒe dugã enye Oslo." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Russia (Россия) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 144,463,451 lɔƒo (2017). Russia ƒe dugã enye Moscow." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Lithuania (Lietuva) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 3,341,966 lɔƒo. Lithuania ƒe dugã enye Vilnius." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Womebu Ukrainetɔwo be wonye woawo ŋutɔ ƒe dukɔmeviwo ƒe akpa aɖeke o eye le esia ta wowɔa dɔ le nɔnɔme sesẽwo me zi geɖe le Russia-nyigbawo dzi, alesi wowɔ nu ɖe ​​Ukraine ŋu alea da le nubabla si wowɔ le ƒe 1654. (Ukrainetɔ 10,000 ku le nɔnɔme siwo me amegbetɔ ƒe nɔnɔme mele o me esime wonɔ Ladoga Tɔdzisasrãa tum.) Esia na Hetman Ivan Mazepa te ŋu wɔ tɔtrɔ kpata si wowɔ le ƒe 1708 me. Le ƒe 1775 me la, Russia tsrɔ̃ Ukrainetɔwo ƒe Cossacktɔwo kple woƒe mɔ̃ sesẽ, Sichtɔwo, tsɔ Ukrainetɔ geɖewo wɔ kluviwoe, eye wòwɔ ɖoɖo ɖe Russification ŋu - si nye Ukrainetɔwo ƒe gbegbɔgblɔ kple dekɔnuwo tsɔtsrɔ̃ le se nu to Russia dziɖuɖumegãwo dzi. Ðoɖo sia ƒe kpɔɖeŋu ɖedzesiwoe nye Ems Edict (Rus. Эмский указ) kple Russia subɔsubɔhakplɔla Pyotr Valuev (Rus. Валуевский циркуляр) ƒe sedede, si xe mɔ na Ukrainetɔwo be woagazã wo degbe ." },
        { "cell": "decimals", "text": "Paraguay nye Amerika dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Paraguay ƒe dugã enye Asuncion. Edo liƒo kple Argentina le eƒe dzigbe kple anyieheɣetoɖoƒe gome, Brazil le eƒe ɣedzeƒe kple dzieheɣedzeƒe, eye Bolivia le eƒe anyieheɣetoɖoƒe gome. Ame siwo ade miliɔn 6.1 ye le eme, eye wo dometɔ siwo ade miliɔn 2.3 le fiadu kple du gãtɔ kekeake si nye Asunción, kple metro nuto si ƒo xlãe me." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "8. Samuel ƒe agbalẽ gbãtɔ kple evelia, — Sh'muel (שמואל)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "9. Fiawo ƒe agbalẽ gbãtɔ kple evelia, — M'lakhim (מלכים)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "13. Nyagblɔɖila wuieve mamlea wo le agbalẽ ɖeka me — Tre Asar (תרי עשר)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "17. Hawo ƒe ha, — Shir ha-Shirim (שיר השירים)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "19. Konyifahawo, — Ekha (איכה), si wo ga yɔna be Kinot (קינות)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "23. Ezra si me Nexemia le, — Ezra (עזרא), si me N'khemya (נחמיה) le" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "24. Kronika ƒe agbalẽ gbãtɔ kple evelia, — Divre ha-Yamim (דברי הימים), si wo ga yɔna be Divre (דברי)" },
        { "cell": "ordinal-latin", "text": "John Agyekum Kufuor (si wodzi Dzome 18, 1938) nye Ghana dunyahela si nye Ghana ƒe dukplɔla ewolia tso Dzove 7, 2001 vaseɖe Dzove 7, 2009. Enye Afrika Dukɔwo ƒe Habɔbɔ ƒe Zimenɔla atɔ̃lia tso ƒe 2007 va ɖo ƒe 2008." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Anyiehe Korea nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 51,446,201 (2017), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 100,210 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Vietnam nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Hanoi, dugã lolotɔwu enye Ho Chi Minh City. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 85,789,573 (2009), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 331,690 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Xexleme enye 1,160,000. Anyigba fe lolome enye 17,364 km2. Amega le duko me enye Mswati III." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Thailand nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Bangkok. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 64,785,909 (2010), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 513,120 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Cambodia nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Phnom Penh. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 13,388,910 (2008), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 181,035 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Laos nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Vientiane. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 5,621,000 (2005), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 236,800 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Indonesia nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Jakarta. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 237,424,363 (2010), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 1,904,569 km2." },
        { "cell": "units", "text": "Singapore nye Asia dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe toxɔdu enye Singapore. Amewo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme enye 5,535,000 (2015), anyigbã ƒe lolome enye 719,1 km2." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Kufuor enye Asantetɔ. Wodzii le Kumasi. Srɔ̃a ŋkɔ enye Theresa Kufuor (tɔgbuiyɔŋkɔ Mensah), eye vi atɔ̃ le wosi. Kufuor de Osei Tutu Boarding School (1951-53), Prempeh College (1954-58), Lincoln's Inn, London (1959-1961) kple Exeter College le University of Oxford (1961-1964)." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Roger Federer ɖu Rafael Nadal dzi 7–6, 4–6, 7–6, 2–6, 6–2. Esiae enye ƒe atɔ̃lia tri ɖe enu si me Federer ɖu dzi le Wimbledon." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Le ƒe 1914 me la, Fiagã Nicholas II xe mɔ ɖe Taras Shevchenko, si nye Ukrainetɔ agbalẽŋlɔla xɔŋkɔ aɖe dzidzi ƒe ƒe 100 xɔxɔ le Russia Fiaɖuƒea me nu. Le ƒe 1917 ƒe gɔmedzedze la, February ƒe Tɔtrɔ Kpata si Alexander Kerensky nɔ ŋgɔ na la mu fiaɖuƒea, na Russia zu dukɔmevinyenye, eye wòna mɔnukpɔkpɔ dukɔ aɖe si wote ɖe anyi tsã be woaʋli woƒe ablɔɖe ta. Esi Lenin va xɔ dziɖuɖu vɔ la, edze Dukɔmeviʋa si dzɔ le ƒe 1917–1921 me kple aʋa si dzɔ le Ukraine Republic kple Soviet Russia dome, si na woma Ukraine ɖe Poland kple Russia dome (tso ƒe 1922 me, abe Soviet Union ƒe akpa aɖe ene). Le ƒe 1932-1933 me la, Soviet dziɖuɖu si nɔ Joseph Stalin ƒe kpɔkplɔ te gbɔe Holodomor (dɔwuame si wowɔ kple asi), si dukɔ geɖe le xexeame katã da asi ɖe edzi be enye ameƒomevi aɖewo tsɔtsrɔ̃ ɖa ɖe Ukrainetɔwo ŋu eye wobu akɔnta be ame miliɔn 10 ku la tso . . ." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Le ƒe alafa 15 lia kple 16 lia me la, woɖo Ukraine bubumewo - Cossacktɔwo, aʋawɔla siwo ʋli dukɔa ta tso amedzidzedze siwo te ɖe wo ŋu me. Russiatɔwo va Ukraine-nyigbawo dzi le ƒe alafa 17 lia me, eye le Ukraine ƒe Ðokuisiʋa si wowɔ ɖe Polandtɔwo ƒe ameteteɖeanyi ŋu le ƒe 1648-1654 me le Bohdan Khmelnytsky ƒe kpɔkplɔ te ta la, wode asi nubabla te kple Russia le ƒe 1654 me ." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Le ƒe 1937-1938 me la, NKVD (si wova yɔ emegbe be USSR ƒe Ememenyawo Gbɔkpɔha) da tu Ukraine kple Belarus nunyala, nutalawo, kple dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunyala geɖe, eye woɖi woƒe kukuawo ɖe Bykivnyan Ave si le Kyiv, afisi wotu ŋkuɖodzikpe na wo le le Soviet Union ƒe mumu megbe ." },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Ghana: The Autobiography of Kwame Nkrumah (1957) ISBN 0-901787-60-4" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Africa Must Unite (1963) ISBN 0-901787-13-2" },
        { "cell": "ranges", "text": "Neo-Colonialism: the Last Stage of Imperialism (1965) ISBN 0-901787-23-X" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Dɔlelea bɔ ɖe tropicwo kple tropicviwo nutome siwo te ɖe anyigbatitina la ŋu me. Eɖewoe nye Sub-Saharan Africa, Asia, and Latin America. World Health Organization bui be le ƒe 2012 me la, malaria le ame million 207 . Le ƒema me la, dɔa wu ame abe tso 473,000 yi 789,000 ene siwodometɔ geɖe nye ɖeviwo tso Africa. Malaria kple ahedada wodoa ka ɖeka eye wogblea nu le du ƒe ŋgɔyiyi ŋu. Le Africa la, wobuibe egblea ga woade abe $12 billion USD le ƒe ɖeka me to eƒe dada , dɔmateŋuwɔwɔ kple nugbegble le tourism ŋu la me." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Esi wòde suku vɔ la, eva ge ɖe $400mm AIG African Infrastructure Fund me abe gadodo ƒe dɔwɔla ene." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Atsu dze eƒe abo fofo gɔme le Porto, eye woyi edzi le Rio Ave hã. Le 2013, Chelsea xoe €3.5 million, kẽ wotsoena Vitesse Arnhem, Everton, Bournemouth kple Málaga." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Le Dzove 13, 2006 dzi la, Premier League habɔbɔ si nye Arsenal de asi Adebayor te ɖe £3 miliɔn si wogblɔ be exɔ ta. Wotsɔ megbeŋkɔ nɛ be \"Baby Kanu\" le esi wòɖi Arsenal ƒe ɣletivi tsãtɔ Nwankwo Kanu, amesi Adebayor subɔa trɔ̃ le eƒe sɔhɛmenɔɣi ta. Le 4 Dzodze 2006 dzi la, Adebayor wɔ eƒe Arsenal ƒe ŋgɔdonya le Premier League hoʋiʋli aɖe me le Birmingham City eye wòƒo go le miniti 21 megbe, eye Arsenal ɖu dzi 2-0. Adebayor nɔ kplu ɖeka me le Arsenal ƒe duɖimekeke yi ƒe 2006 UEFA Champions League Final ta." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Adebayor da Arsenal ƒe dziɖuɖu goal ɖe Manchester United dzi tsɔ na Arsenal ɖu dzi 1–0 le Old Trafford, si nye woƒe ligi dziɖuɖu gbãtɔ le ƒe 2006–07 ƒe ɣeyiɣia me. Do ŋgɔ le fefea me la, woɖiɖi Adebayor ɖe anyi le abɔklugui ade ƒe aɖaka me be woana Arsenal naxɔ tohehe, si Gilberto Silva xɔ eye wòɖee. Woɖe asi le Adebayor ŋu le ƒe 2007 ƒe League Cup ƒe nuwuwu si Arsenal bu 2–1 ɖe Chelsea dzi. Wotsɔ kaɖi dzĩ fiae le nyaʋiʋli aɖe si dzɔ le fefea ƒe nuwuwu lɔƒo si me Chelsea kple Arsenal fefewɔlawo siaa kpɔ gome le megbe. Wogblɔ be etsɔ atam ƒu gbe ɖe Frank Lampard ŋu. Emegbe FA gaxe mɔ nɛ be wòagawɔ fefe ɖeka o eye woado fe nɛ £7,500 le esi wòdo kpo dzodzo le fefewɔƒea enumake ta, eye woxe mɔ ɖe fefe etɔ̃ nu le esi wòxɔ kaɖi dzĩ la ta. Adebayor kple Lampard siaa gbe esia." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "Le 18 July 2009 dzi la, Adebayor de asi ƒe atɔ̃ ƒe nubabla te kple Manchester City ɖe asiɖeɖe le eŋu ƒe fe si woxɔ se be anɔ £25 miliɔn ƒe nuto me. Eda go le eƒe bɔlƒoƒo gbãtɔ me na City esi wòwɔ aʋa kple Blackburn esi wòda tu tso meta 18 le miniti etɔ̃lia me. Le eƒe aƒeme bɔlƒoƒo gbãtɔ me la, Adebayor ƒo go le miniti 17 lia me le dziɖuɖu 1–0 ɖe Wolverhampton Wanderers dzi me, eye ehati dzomeŋɔli ƒe asidede agbalẽ te Carlos Tevez kpe ɖe eŋu. Eƒo go le eƒe Premier League hoʋiʋli etɔ̃lia si kplɔ wo nɔewo ɖo me, eye wòtsɔ ta na aʋadziɖula le aʋadziɖuɖu si woɖu Portsmouth dzi 1–0 le duta me." },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "By 2016, demand for Akunyili Crosby’s work, which she produces slowly, far outweighed supply, prompting her prices to soar at auction.[69] She became one of the artists featured in Nathaniel Kahn's 2018 documentary The Price of Everything where she discusses her career and attitude to her art market.[70] It culminated with her painting Drown being sold at Sotheby's contemporary art auction in November 2016 for $900,000. Her first painting to come to market was Untitled which sold for $93,000 in September 2016 at Sotheby's New York.[71]" },
        { "cell": "currency", "text": "In March 2017, a work by Akunyili Crosby titled The Beautyful Ones (Series #1c), the first painting of five belonging to The Beautyful Ones Series, was sold by a private collector for $3 million at Christie's London.[72][73][74][75]" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Yudatɔwo yɔna woƒe Biblia be Tanak alo Hebri Biblia. Kristotɔwo hã yɔna woƒe Biblia be Ŋɔŋlɔ Kɔkɔe. Wo ma agbalẽ sia ɖe akpa eve me. Akpa gbãtɔ enye Nubabla xoxoa eye evelia enye Nubabla yeyea. Kristotɔwo ƒe hame aɖewo tsɔ agbalẽ si wo yɔna be Apokrifa kpe ɖe woƒe Biblia ŋuti. Agbalẽ ɖe wo le Roma \"Catholic\" kple \"Eastern Orthodox\" tɔwo ƒe Biblia me si wo mele Yudatɔwo ƒe Tanak me o." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Agbalẽ 39 ye le Hebri Biblia (Hebri:תנ\"ך) me. Ameaɖewo yɔnae be Hebri Biblia elabena Hebritɔwo gbɔ agbalẽa tso. Ameaɖewo hã wo yɔnae nenema elabena Hebrigbe me wo ŋlɔe ɖo. Eya wo ŋutɔ wo yɔnae be Tanak elabena woƒe agbalẽ le akpa etɔ̃ me. Akpa etɔ̃ sia wonye Tora (nufafiawo), Nevi'im (nyagblɔɖilawo) kple Ketuvim (nuŋɔŋlɔwo)." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Nubabla yeye la ku ɖe Yesu Kristo ƒe agbe kple nufafia ŋuti. Apostolo Paulo kple nusrɔla bubuawo ƒe agbalẽwo si woŋlɔ ɖo ɖe Kristotɔwo ƒe hame gbãtɔwo kpakple Yohanes ƒe Nyaɖeɖefia la wo katã le eme. Agbalẽ 27 ye le Nubabla yeyea me. Woŋlɔ agbalẽ siawo dometɔ geɖe le Helagbe me. Agbalẽawoe nye:" },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Eʋegbe nye Eʋeawo ƒe gbe siwo dona. Wo dona Eʋegbe le Ghana, Togo kple Benin Dãhumey siwo le Afrika ƒe ɣetoɖoƒe lɔƒo la me. Gbe dodo siwo teɖe Eʋegbe ŋu wonye Fɔ̃gbe kpakple Adzágbe. Esiawo katã wonye Gbe siwo doƒome kple Ʋegbe." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Germania ye ŋutsu Diedrich Hermann Westermann, si srɔ̃ nugeɖe le Afrika ŋuti la, ŋlɔ agbalẽwo geɖe le Eʋegbe ŋuti. Ame bubu aɖe siwo srɔ̃ nu tso Eʋegbe ŋuti wonye Gilbert Ansre, Hounkpati B. Capo, Herbert Stahlke, Roberto Pazzi, Felix K. Ameka, Alan Stewart Duthie. Gake le Eʋenyigbadzi la Sam J. Obianim nye amesi ŋlɔ Ʋegbe gbalẽ geɖewo. Agbalẽ siawo dometɔ ɖeka enye \"Amegbetɔa alo Agbezuge ƒe ŋuti nya\" ." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Eʋegbe ƒomevi vovowo li. Wo dometɔ aɖewoe nye Aŋlɔ, Tɔŋu (Tɔŋgu), Avenor, Agave, Ʋedome, Awlan, Gbín, Pekí, Kpándo, Vhlin, Hó, Avɛ́no, Vo, Kpelen, Vɛ́, Danyi, Agu, Fodome, Wancé, Wací, kple Adángbe." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Eʋenyigba de lolo ge abe Asãte kple Dahome, siwo le eƒe goawo kple eve dzi, ene. Ke Eʋeawo katã meƒo ƒu ɖekae wɔ fiaɖuƒe gã abe woamawo ene kpɔ o ." },
        { "cell": "abbrev", "text": "Germaniatɔwoe dze Ʋegbe ŋɔŋlɔ gɔme. Wozã ŋɔŋlɔdzesi si woyɔna le Aŋlesigbe me be African Reference alphabet kpakple Latin alfabet la kpakple dzesi ʋeaɖewo kpe ɖe eŋu tso International Phonetic Alphabet la me." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Biblia nye Yudatɔwo, Kristotɔwo ƒe hame vovoawo kpakple ha si woyɔna be \"Eastern Orthodox\" hame le yevugbe me la ƒe agbalẽ vevietɔ na subɔsubɔ. Vovototo suea ɖewo le hasiawo ƒe Bibliawo me." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Tora alo \"nufafiawo\" wonye Mose ƒe agbalẽ atɔ̃awo. Wo yɔna agbalẽ atɔ̃awo le Hebrigbe me be \"Chumash\" eye Helatɔwo hã wo yɔnae be \"Pentateuch\". Tora agbalẽawo wo nye:" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Agbalẽ wuiɖeka siwo le K'tuvim la me wonye:" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Togbɔ be ɖekawɔwɔ blibo mele wo dome o hã la, fiaɖufe gã eve mawo dometɔ aɖeke meɖu wo dzi kpɔ o, ke boŋ Eʋeawo nɔ wo ɖokui si, vaseɖe esime yevunya va ." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Wotsɔ dzesi sia ( ˜ ) fia be wogblɔna alfabet la le ŋɔtimegbe me." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Dzesi bubuwo fiana be ele be na bɔbɔ gbe alo na kɔ wo gbe ɖe dzi." },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Metsɔ nyasiawo tso Eŋlisi Wikipiɖia la me" },
        { "cell": "latin-in-native", "text": "Agbalẽ siawo le Eŋlisigbe- kple Dzamagbe me." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Le 2010 me la, ame million&nbsp;925 undernourished woe le xexeame, eye ame million&nbsp;80 kpeɖeŋu tso ƒe 1990. Wobui be vitaminwo kple nunyiamewo me le ame billion bubuwo si o. Le ƒe 2010 me la, wobui be protein-energy malnutrition he ame 600,000 ɖe ku me tso ku abe 883,000 le ƒe 1990. Nunyiame manɔamesi bubuwo abe iodine deficiency kple iron deficiency anemia, ame abe 84,000 bubu geɖe ɖe ku me. Vaseɖe ƒe 2010 dzi la, Undernutrition hea 1.4% na disability adjusted life years va nɛ. Abe akpa etɔ mama na ekuwo kata tso undernutrition gbɔ; gake, zigeɖee womebune nenema o. Le ƒe 2010 me la, eyae he nyɔnuwo kple ɖeviwo ƒe ku abe mellion 1.5 gake wobuibbe xexlemea wu ame million&nbsp;3. Ɖeviwo abe million 165&nbsp;le stunted growth tso dɔlelea me. Undernutrition bɔ le dukɔsiwo ŋgɔ yiyi me bɔ ɖo o." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ghanatɔ siwo le Germany dukɔa me la nɔna Germany dukɔa ƒe akpa yikɛ woyɔna be Hamburg, Berlin, kple Bremen, le akpa yikɛ woyɔna be Ruhr nutoame. Eye le akpa yikɛ woyɔna be Frankfurt la Ghanatɔwo xɔ akpa 22.7% ɖe alɔfa dzi. Akpa gãtɔ wo le Hamburg eye agbɔsɔsɔ 23.8% ɖe alɔfa dzi le akpa yikɛ woyɔna be North Rhine-Westphalia. Agbɔsɔsɔ 9.2% ɖe alɔfa dzi le Berlin. Agbɔsɔsɔ 9.8% le Germany dukɔa ƒe akpa yikɛ woyɔna be Hesse eye teƒe sia nye teƒe tsitsi aɖe si ke Ghana tɔwo nɔna ŋutɔ. Ɖe esiata la ŋukɔ sike woyɔna le Ghana be “bɔga” la ɖo tso teƒe siwo yɔ na le Germany dukɔa me la be Humburg." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Ghana dukɔa nye dukɔ si le nɔƒe gbãtɔ le nuxɔxɔ alo ga xɔxɔ me tso wo ɖeviwo gbɔ tso dukɔ bubuwo me. Ghana le nɔƒe ɖeka de ade dzi le wɔna siawo me. Le nugɔmeɖeɖe me alo nu me kuku ɖe fia be ghanavi dzidzi 90% ɖo na ga ɖa Ghana na woƒe ƒome tɔwo eye ɖewo hã ɖo na ga ɖa wu woƒe fetu kora gɔhá." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Le xexeame godoa, Germany le nɔƒe Evelia kplo Amerika ɖo le dukɔ siwo amewo zɔa mɔ tso dukɔ yina. Le UN ƒe ŋukpɔkpɔ nua, le 2017 mea, ame 12,165,083 le Germany dukɔ mean ye gbetatɔwo alo mɔzɔlawo tso dukɔ bubu wo me. Esia fia be le Germany dukɔmetɔ wo ƒe xexleme alo agbɔsɔsɔmea, 14.8% nye mɔzɔlawo alo gbetatɔwo." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Esia sɔ kple akɔdada siwo katã sɔ la ƒe 90.9%." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Esiawo sɔ kple 3.3%, 3.1%, 1.9% kple 0.9% le akɔdada siwo katã wowɔ me." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "me tɔwo ƒe 20% ƒe xexlẽme dzi be woanye nyɔnuwo." },
        { "cell": "percent", "text": "Le Kenya dziɖuɖua ƒe nya nu la, nyɔnuwo kple nyɔnuvi siwo xɔ ƒe 15–49 ƒe 45% to ŋutasẽnuwɔwɔ me." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ[1] eye ​​wònɔ Loiret dɔwɔƒea teƒe" },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "June 2009 le Barcelona, ​​esime wòxɔ ƒe 73.[2]" },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "ƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ, eye ​​emegbe wònye Dumegã teƒenɔla le dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunya," },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Mahmoud Refaat kple Libya Dukplɔlagã tsãtɔ Omar al-Hassi ɖo The International action group for peace in Libya eye ​​wòxɔ ɖoƒe si nye General Coordinator, si wodze egɔme tso... Tunisia ƒe fiadu le nyadzɔdzɔgblɔlawo ƒe kpekpe aɖe me le May 12, 2018 dzi le Europa Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ geɖe ŋkume eye nyadzɔdzɔgblɔmɔnuwo ƒo nu tso eŋu geɖe." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Exɔ ɖoƒewo le dziɖuɖu vovovowo me le France: Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ (ƒe 1954–1961; 1974–1981), Agbledede ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla (ƒe 1961–1966), Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ (ƒe 1967–1968), Europa ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla (ƒe 1981–1985), New Caledonia ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla (ƒe 1985 ), Arab Xexeame ƒe Nusrɔ̃ƒe ƒe Dukplɔla (ƒe 1988–1995). Le ƒe 1992 me, kple Bertrand Hervieu, woɖo Groupe de Seillac eye ​​Groupe de Bruges kplɔe ɖo le ƒe 1995 me, eye wo ame evea siaa nye susuŋutinunyalawo ƒe habɔbɔwo." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "franck Riester (wodzi le 3 Dzove 1974) nye Franse dunyahela. Eyae nye Franseawo ƒe Dekɔnuwo ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla fifia. Enye France Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ tso ƒe 2007 va ɖo ƒe 2018. Enɔ Seine-et-Marne dɔwɔƒea teƒe, eye ​​wònye The Republicans, si woyɔna tsã be Union for a Popular Movement me tɔ tsã." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Quatennens va tsɔ ɖe le dunyahehe me esime wòxɔ ƒe 15 le ƒe 2006 me, esime wowɔ ʋunyaʋunyawɔwɔ gãwo tsɔ tsi tre ɖe dɔwɔse yeye aɖe ŋu le France. Ege ɖe dɔmenyohabɔbɔwo me be yeakpe ɖe aƒemanɔsitɔwo ŋu eye ​​wòva zu Attac habɔbɔa me tɔ. Le ƒe 2006 me la, exɔ suku kɔkɔ ƒe ɖaseɖigbalẽ le Katolikotɔwo ƒe suku kɔkɔ aɖe me le Bondues, Nord. Edze gaŋutinunya sɔsrɔ̃ gɔme le Lille Yunivɛsiti gake edo kpo dodokpɔwo le ƒe evelia me. Emegbe exɔ mɔ̃ɖaŋu ŋuti ɖaseɖigbalẽ eye ​​wòwɔ dɔ abe asisiwo ƒe aɖaŋuɖola ene na ŋusẽdɔwɔƒe si nye EDF." },
        { "cell": "zero-width", "text": "Bonfoh nye RPT ƒe Dunyahehabɔbɔ me tɔ[10] eye ​​wònye RPT ƒe Titinakɔmiti me tɔ tso Bassar Nutome tso RPT ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe dzro enyilia me le December 2006 me." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Le Tedoxe 6, 1957 me la, Ghana dukɔa xɔ ɖokuisinɔnɔ eye Nkrumah zu dukɔa kplɔla. Fianyɔnu Elizabet II ganɔ zia dzi na Ghana ƒe etɔ̃ sɔ̃ŋ hafi eya hã trɔ tso Siamlɔm 1, 1960 dzi." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Sɔlemeha la ƒo ƒu be yeabia hlɔ̃ ɖe dziɖuɖu sia ta. Papa Innocent III ɖe gbeƒã nyitsu aɖe si ɖe gbeƒã atitsogaʋa ɖe Livoniatɔwo ŋu. Bishop Albert woɖe gbeƒãe be Livonia ƒe Bisiɔp to tɔɖiayɔvi Hartwig si tso Uthlede, Bremen kple Hamburg ƒe Fiavi-Bisiɔpgã le ƒe 1199. Albert ɖi go ɖe Riga le ƒe 1200 me kple meli 23 kple Westphalia atitsogaʋawɔla 500. Le ƒe 1201 me la, eɖe Livonia bisiɔpnyenye ƒe zikpui tso Uexküll yi Riga, eye wòxɔ nubabla be woawɔ esia le Riga ƒe hamemegãwo si sesẽe." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Ʋegbe dukɔa ƒe dziɖula enye woƒe Fiaga. Amesi eny Fiaga fifia enye Aƒetɔ Silas Wiah. Eƒe kpukpo ŋukɔ enye Tɔgbe Wiah Kwasi II. Woɖoe Fiaga le Masa 2010 me. Ʋegbe Kpalime le South Dayi Distrikt me si ƒe dugã enye Kpeve. Ghana dukɔa ƒe zimenɔla na distrikt la enye Kafui Bekui." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Wonder Woman (Diana Prince) si siwo wonye DC Comics mele wo Batman dome Superman." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Le World War II\" megbea, sitsoƒe dzilawo milioni 12 ʋutso dusiwo nɔ Germany te yi du yeye siwo wo tso." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Le ƒé 1965 me la, ezã Ford GT Mk.II mɔ̃a kple Bruce McLaren le 24 Hours of Le Mans gake exɔ dzudzɔ esi eƒe gearbox gblẽ. Le ƒéa ƒe gɔmedzedzea me la, eya kple McLaren, exe nɔƒe evelia esi wo ʋli ho le12 Hours of Sebring." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Esi ƒé trɔ la, ekpɔ dziɖuɖu le 4 Hours of Daytona ho ʋiʋlia me esi wozã Ford GT Mk.II mɔ̃a kple Lloyd Ruby , eyidzi kpɔ dziɖuɖu le 12 Hours of Sebring ho ʋiʋlia hã me. Le ɣleti aɖewo megbe l esi woʋli ho kple Denny Hulme la, Miles ganɔ 1966 24 Hours of Le Mans kplɔm, esi Ford megã Leo Beebe, doe kplikpa be yea wɔawɔ gbeƒãɖeɖe le ʋu etɔ̃aaɖewo ƒe nutata siwo wowɔ vɔvɔvɔ la ŋti la ena gbe bel Carroll Shelby ne bɔbɔ ɖe eme si dzi Shelby lɔ̃ ɖo. Eyata le Ford ʋu si wo gawɔ si Bruce McLaren/ Chris Amon kuna la eye woxɔ nɔfe etɔlia le Ford ƒe mɔ̃awo ɖome si wo kple vea ɖitsa kple. The French race officials, after initially agreeing to Ford's dead-heat \"photo-finish\", reneged during the final hour of the race. McLaren's #2 car crossed the finish line just ahead and was declared the winner. It was rumoured that Miles, upset about the team orders, lifted off to allow McLaren to finish a length ahead. Miles was denied the unique achievement of winning Sebring, Daytona, and Le Mans in the same year." },
        { "cell": "roman", "text": "Kristotɔwo ƒe Dutanyanyuigblɔlawo ƒe Ameɖibɔ Gbãtɔ si le Nigeria, si wogayɔna be Kristotɔ Gbãtɔwo ƒe Dutanyanyuigblɔlawo ƒe Tsiẽƒe le Badagry, nye ameɖibɔ si me woɖi ƒe alafa 19 lia kple 20 lia me Europa Kristotɔ Dutanyanyuigblɔla siwo ku le Badagry dugã me kple eƒe nutowo me. Ameɖiƒea le dua ƒe Kɔdzi Mɔdodo Gã la to. Eƒe Plus Code ƒe nɔnɔmetatawo le Google Maps dzi enye CV7Q+CPR, 103101, Badagry, Nigeria. Nuŋlɔɖi aɖewo gblɔ be woɖi dutanyanyuigblɔla siwo wu 200 le afisia. Wotu kpe xɔasi aɖe tsɔ ɖo ŋku dutanyanyuigblɔla kukuawo dzi. Egbea la, ameɖibɔa nye ŋutinya me teƒe siwo hea tsaɖilawo vaa Badagry dugã me la dometɔ ɖeka." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "DENYIGBA Denyigba la le nye kple wo siã dzɔ" },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Akowo (IPA:/ˈɑːkəʊˌwəʊ/) nye xe ƒomevi ɖeka si wole hame abe 350 sɔŋ. Womana xe siawo ɖe akpa gã eve me. Woyɔna wo le Eŋglisigbe me be cockatoo kpakple parrot. Akowo bɔ ɖe xexeame dukɔ siwo me dzoxɔxɔ sɔgbɔ le la me." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Abe senyala kple asitsala ene la, enye dziɖuɖumegã le Kofi Abrefa Busia ƒe Ŋgɔyiyiha dziɖuɖua me. Kufuor tsi tre abe New Patriotic Party (NPP) ƒe ametiakɔdala ene le ƒe 1996 ƒe akɔdada me, eye wòɖu dzi le ƒe 2000 kple 2004 me. Esi wòɖu dzi zi eve la, eɖe asi le dunyahehe ŋu le ƒe 2008 me. Ame geɖe yɔnɛ be Gentle Giant." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Kufuor dze dɔ gɔme le Kumasi abe Town Clerk ene. Wotia Kufuor abe MP le 1969 do ɖe Parliament. Le ƒe 1969 me la, wotiae be woa nye Member of Parliament. Le ɣemaɣi la, enɔ gɔvment me." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Rawlings tɔ ŋkɔ enye James Ramsay John, amesi tso Scotland le United Kingdom. Eya kple srɔ̃a Maria tso Scotland va wɔ dɔ le United Africa Company (UAC) le Gɛ̃. Nɔa enye Aƒenɔ Victoria Agbotui tso Dzelukoƒe, si te ɖe Keta ŋuti le Vɔlta nutome. Rawlings ɖe Nana Konadu Agyeman si nye Asante. Wodzi vi ene, nyɔnuvi etɔ̃ kple ŋutsuvi ɖeka." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Le Masa 4, 1979 fɔŋli me la, asrafoaɖewo vayi ɖe Rawlings kple xɔ̃awo tso game. Hoʋiʋli do le Gɛ̃ gbɔme ŋkekea katã gake le ɣetrɔ me la, Kodzo Boakye-Gyan ɖe gbeƒã le nuƒomɔawo dzi le dukɔame godo bena Supreme Military Council dziɖuɖua ge. Asrafoawo ɖo Rawlings woƒe zimenɔla, eye wotsɔ ŋkɔ na dziɖuɖua be Armed Forces Revolutionary Council (AFRC)." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Le Dzome 31, 1981 dzi la, Rawlings tso ɖe Limann ƒe dziɖuɖua ŋu. Hoʋiʋli ga nɔ anyi gake enu me sẽ abe 1979 tɔ o. Ghana ƒe kplɔla tatiawo katã ge eye woɖo Provisional National Defence Council (PNDC) abe dziɖuɖu yeyea. Rawlings ga nye zimenɔla na PNDC hã." },
        { "cell": "initialism", "text": "Esime Rawlings ƒe dziɖuɖu nɔ dididi la, amewo dze babia be ehiã be Ghana aga ɖo dziɖuɖu tatia alebe dua kɔkpɔkplɔ na nɔ ɖoɖo kple sewo si dukɔa katã aɖo nu. Le ƒea ɖewo megbe la, Rawlings va lɔ̃ be dziɖuɖua natrɔ. Eɖe asi le asrafo dɔ ŋu eye wo ɖo be yea nɔ akametatiaa me. Woɖo National Democratic Congress (NDC), eye Rawlings nye woƒe ŋgɔnɔla. Ghanatɔwo tia Rawlings abe dukplɔla yeyea gake le seawo nu la, elebe woa gbugbɔ dukplɔla atia ƒe ene sia ene megbe. Rawlings ƒe dziɖuɖu dze egɔme le Dzove 7, 1993 dzi eye ewunu Dzove 7, 1997. Wo ga tia Rawlings le Dzome 2000 eyata eyi dzi tso 1997 vaseɖe Dzove 7, 2001. Eseawo me ɖe mɔ be woatia dukplɔla ɖeke wu zi eve o alebe le ƒe enyi megbe la, Rawlings do le zia dzi." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Denmark (Danmark) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Denmark do liƒo kple Germany kpakple Sweden. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 5 748 769 lɔƒo (2017). Denmark ƒe dugã enye Copenhagen." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Finland (Finngbe: Suomi) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Europa ƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo. Finland do liƒo kple Russia,Norway kpakple Sweden. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 5 507 101 lɔƒo (2017). Finland ƒe dugã enye Helsinki." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Estonia (Eesti) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 1 315 635 lɔƒo (2017). Estonia ƒe dugã enye Tallinn." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "France alo Frãnse nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Frans ƒe dugã enye Paris. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 68 605 616 lɔƒo (2025). Gbe si wogblɔna le woƒe dɔwɔƒewo le dua me enye fransegbe." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Greece (Ελλάδα) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Greece ƒe dugã enye Athens. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 10 955 000 lɔƒo (2015)." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 12 864 634 lɔƒo (2020)" },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Hamea ƒe dɔwɔƒe gãtɔ le Ho, si nye Vɔlta nutome dugã la. Ame abe 600,000 ye le hamea me fifia eye ha 750 lɔƒo woɖo vadeɖe fifia. Nunɔla tsitsitɔ enye mɔɖeretɔ." },
        { "cell": "grouped", "text": "Stockholm nye Sweden dugã enye. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 935,619 lɔƒo (2016)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "OBE (24 September 1844 –1938) nye The Niger ƒe Saɖaganunɔlagã tso ƒe 1876 vaseɖe ƒe 1926." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Le ewɔwɔ me la, woyɔe be ZX81 Amadede kple ZX82. Woyɔe be ZX Spectrum be woatsɔ afia mɔ̃a ƒe amadede ɖeɖefia, si to vovo tso yevu kple blɔ ƒe ɖeɖefia si do ŋgɔ nɛ, ZX81. Woɖe Spectrum ɖe go abe ƒomevi vovovo ade ene, tso gɔmedzedze ƒe ɖoɖo si me 16 KB RAM le si woɖe ɖe go le ƒe 1982 me va ɖo ZX Spectrum +3 si me 128 KB RAM le eye wotu ɖe floppy disk drive me le ƒe 1987 me. Wo katã wodzra wo dometɔ siwo wu miliɔn 5 le xexeame katã (ne míexlẽ woƒe nɔnɔmetata siwo womewɔ le se nu o)." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Clarisse Bogdanna Agbegnenou (wodzi le 25 Lele 1992) nye Franse judokatɔ. Esi wònɔ ho ʋlim le −63 kg kpekpeme ƒe hatsotso me la, exɔ Europa ƒe tanyenye le ƒe 2013 me, xexeame ƒe tanyenye le ƒe 2014 me, Olympic klosalo medaasi le ƒe 2016 me, kple Olympic sika medalẽ le ƒe 2020 ƒe Dzomeŋɔli Olympics le Siamlɔm 2021 me." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Wodzi Njideka le ƒe akpe ɖeka alɔfa asieke blanyi vɔ et me eye wonyi le Enugu le Nigeria. Eƒe dzɔtsoƒe tso Igboe eye wòdoa gbe eve siwoe nye Igbo kple Iŋlisigbe. Eƒe ƒometɔ aɖewoe nye Akunyili Crosby si nye fofoa, Chike Akunyili, dada si nye amekola kple Dora_Akunyili si nye atikeŋutinunyalagãwo Pharmacology ƒe nufialagã le Nigeria -7 ƒe yunivesiti me eye wònye dukɔa ƒe nuɖuɖu kple atike ŋuti dɔwɔƒe ƒe dɔdzikpɔlagã tsã. Akunyili Crosby ʋu yi ɖe Legos le esime wòxɔ ƒe wuiet- be yeade sek1ndrisuku si woyɔna be fianyɔnuwo ƒe kɔledzi si le Yaba Legos nuto la me. Dada ɖu Amerikatɔwo ƒe loto agbalēvi si woɖe ŋkɔ na be ‘’green card’’ na eƒe ƒomea si wɔe be Akunyili kple nɔvia ŋutsuwo te ŋu yi ɖe Amerika dukɔ la me eye wona ga ƒe kpekpeɖeŋu wo be woade suku ahasr- nu le afi ma." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Great women artists. Phaidon Press. 2019. p. 28.ISBN_-0714878775." },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Iro; didime, kekeme, kple nɔnɔme vovovowo, ate ŋu anɔ awu sia si ku ɖe ɣeyiɣi si me edola la le. Woate ŋu awɔ Iro ati Buba tso avɔ vovovowo me, abe Aso-oke/Aso-Ofi, Adire, Aran, Segosen, Jawu, Aso olona, Seda, ka, alo Damask/Brocade. Wotsɔa Iro ati Buba ƒoa taku kple Gele kpakple Ipele zi geɖe. Woate ŋu ado Iro hã Buba manɔmee abe awu ene le eɖokui si, eye Yoruba ƒe awudodo ƒe akpa bubuawo le eme.[ -1][ -2]" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Gele_(bla_ta): nye Yorubatɔwo ƒe dekɔnuwo ƒe tababla si le atsy- ɖoɖo vovowo me. Woate ŋu taku sia tso avɔ dzati alo falɛfalɛwo me abe aso-oke, damask, adire alo akara ene. Amadede, nɔnɔme, kple atsyɔ̃ɖonu vovovowo ate ŋu anɔ taku sia si ̎geleˮ ku ɖe ɣiyiɣi si me amea la nu.[ -3]" },
        { "cell": "signed-number", "text": "Ipele: enye taɖedzivɔ si wotsona dana ɖe abɔ alo tana ɖe alidzi nenye be mieta avɔ vɔ. Woate ŋu atsɔ avɔ si wotsɔ wɔ gele alo esi to vovo la hã awɔe faa. Ipele ate ŋu anɔ lolome ɖe sia ɖe me, eŋeŋe ɖe nɔnɔme vovovowo me, kple atyɔ̃e ɖoɖo vovovowo me.[ -4]." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "b. Iŋlis yevuwo ƒe fiaga Prempe I ƒe aboyoɖeɖe" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Afɔ kɔklɔ - Afɔ kɔklɔ ƒe sakramentoe nana be miwɔna ɖeka kple Yesu Kristo. E zuna abe ŋukuɖoɖonudzi nami be lɔlɔ, kɔkɔenyenye, ɖokuibɔbɔ, tsɔtsɔke, kple amenuveve nanɔ miasi. Edze be amesiame sixɔ mawutsideta tó tsi me la, woaklɔ afɔ nɛ le Yesu Kristo ƒe ŋkɔme. Miawɔ Afɔklɔ na mianɔewo gasiagame ne miekpɔ bena ehiã." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "TAM Linhas Aéreas ƒe ayameʋu A320 ɖeka do le mɔ dzi le Brazil eye wòle dzo enumake. Emenɔlawo katã ku." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Paraguay nye dukɔ madeŋgɔ, eye wòle nɔƒe 105 lia le Amegbetɔ ƒe Ŋgɔyiyi ƒe Nuŋlɔɖi me. Enye Mercosur, Dukɔ Ƒoƒuawo, Amerika Dukɔwo ƒe Habɔbɔ, Habɔbɔ si Mewɔ Ðeka O kple Lima Ƒuƒoƒo ƒe gɔmeɖoanyila. Tsɔ kpe ɖe eŋu la, Luque-du si le Asuncion dugã me lae nye Anyiehe Amerika Bɔlƒohabɔbɔ ƒe nɔƒe." },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "Axioms of Kwame Nkrumah (1967) ISBN 0-901787-54-X" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "I Speak of Freedom (1973) ISBN 0-901787-14-0" },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "I believe in Jesus Christ, his only Son, our Lord," },
        { "cell": "letter-name", "text": "\"Wodzi amegbetɔwo katã ablɔɖeviwoe eye wodzena bubu kple gomekpɔkpɔ sɔsɔe. Susu kple dzitsinya le wo dometɔ ɖesiaɖe si eyata wodze be woanɔ anyi le ɖekawɔwɔ blibo me.\" — Kpeɖodzinya ɖoɖo I" },
        { "cell": "exponent", "text": "Le ƒe 1988 ƒe Dzomeŋɔli Olympics me la, exɔ dzesi 10.59 le meta 100 me. Le ƒe 1992 kple 1996 siaa me la, egaƒu du meta 200 eye wònye meta 4 × 100 ƒe ƒuƒoƒoawo ƒe akpa aɖe." },
        { "cell": "arithmetic", "text": "- \"Lɔlɔ̃ha siwo tso gaxɔ me = Aus dem Gefängnis\" , Vienna, Löcker, 2010 (ISBN 978-3-85409-565-1)." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Hilla Limann (Dzome 12, 1934 &ndash; Dzove 23, 1998) enye Ghana dukplɔla tso Anyɔnyɔ 24, 1979 vaseɖe Dzome 31, 1981." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Ɖokuisinɔnɔ Ŋkeke le St. Vincent & the Grenadines - Kele 27" },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Riga nye toxɔdu kple dugã lolotɔwu le Latvia. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 643,615 lɔƒo (2015). Woɖo Riga le ƒe 1201 me, eye wònye Hanseatic League me tɔ tsã. Riga ƒe ŋutinya me titina nye UNESCO Xexeame ƒe Domenyinu, si wonya ɖe eƒe Art Nouveau/Jugendstil xɔtuɖaŋu kple ƒe alafa 19 lia me ati xɔtuɖaŋu ta. Riga nye [[Europa ƒe Dekɔnuwo ƒe Fiadu]. ] le ƒe 2014 me, tsɔ kpe ɖe Umeå ŋu le Sweden. Riga nye ƒe 2006 NATO Takpekpe, Eurovision Hadzidzi Hoʋiʋli 2003, 2013 Xexeame Nyɔnuwo ƒe Curling Hoʋiʋli, kple IIHF Ŋutsuwo ƒe Xexeame ƒe Tsikpe Hockey Aʋadziɖuɖu le ƒe 2006, 2021, kple 2023. Enye afisi Europa Dukɔwo ƒe Ðekawɔha ƒe dɔwɔƒe si nye Europatɔwo ƒe Elektrɔnik Kadodowo Ŋuti Ðoɖowɔlawo (BEREC) le. Le ƒe 2017 me la, wotsɔ ŋkɔ nɛ be Europatɔwo ƒe Nuɖuɖu Ŋuti Nuto. Le ƒe 2019 me la, Riga xɔ duta amedzro siwo wu miliɔn 1.4&nbsp;. Dua nye Riga Dukɔwo Dome Yameʋudzeƒe, si yameʋudzeƒe gãtɔ kekeake si me amewo sɔ gbɔ ɖo wu le Baltik-dukɔwo me. Riga nye Eurocities me tɔ," },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Akpa etɔe le afɔdzido ŋu: do ɖeɖe ɖe anyigba, do vi ɖeɖe ɖe anyigba gota, kple xɔ. Edoa yi tome abe meter 3&nbsp (afɔ 10&nbsp) eye wokeke abe m 1 (afɔ 3.2 ). World Health Organization ɖoe be woatui ɖe afisi eƒe didime tso aƒeme gbɔ anɔ bɔbɔe na egbɔ yiyi eye eƒe ʋeʋe ha manye tukaɖa o. Ele be eƒe tete ɖe tometsi kple gotatsi na didi vie be mahe pollution ve o. Mele be edo si woɖe ɖe atia nawu centimeter 25 (inche 9.8 ) be ɖeviwo mage dze eme o. Kekle megaɖo eme o be nudzodzoewo makpɔ mɔ age ɖe eme o. Ahia be woatu doa ne wome le ezam o. Ne edoa yɔ abe meter 0.5 (afɔ 1.6), ele be woalɔe alo woatu yeye woaɖe xɔa ɖa alo woagbugbɔ tui ɖe teƒe yeyea. Belele na fecal sludge si woɖe tso doa me nyea nusese. Ne womewɔe nyuie o la, ehea yame kple lamese tukaɖa va nɛ." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Wodzi Akufo-Addo eye wonyii le Accra, enye Edward kple Adeline Akufo-Addo ƒe viŋutsu . Exɔ eƒe gɔmedzesuku le Accra, eye wòde Dziɖuɖu Ŋutsuviwo ƒe Suku gbã eye emegbe wòde Rowe Road Suku. Akufo-Addo yi United Kingdom hena eƒe sekɛndrisuku, eye wòsrɔ̃ nu le Lancing College (ƒe 1957–61) . Etrɔ gbɔ va aƒe le Ghana eye le ƒe 1964 me la, edze Ghana Yunivɛsiti dede gɔme, eye wòwu suku nu kple gaŋutinunya ƒe ɖaseɖigbalẽ le ƒe 1967 me . Akufo-Addo trɔ yi UK be yeasrɔ̃ senyawo eye woyɔe be wòava senyalawo ƒe dɔwɔƒe le England (Middle Temple) le ƒe 1971 me eye le Ghana le ƒe 1975 . Emegbe etrɔ yi Ghana eye tso ƒe 1975 va ɖo ƒe 1979 me la, ewɔ dɔ le UV Campbell ƒe dɔwɔƒe. Le ƒe 1979 me la, ewɔ ɖeka ɖo senyawo gbɔ kpɔƒe si nye Akufo-Addo, Prempeh & Co ." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Paul Steiner: Christaller, Joh. Gottlieb. Le Allgemeine Deutsche Biographie (ADB). Volume 47, Duncker & Humblot, Leipzig 1903, pp. 480-483 me." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Diedrich Hermann Westermann: Christaller, Johann Gottlieb. Le Neue Deutsche Biographie (NDB). Volume 3, Duncker & Humblot, Berlin 1957, (ISBN:3-428-00184-2), p. 219 ( digitized) me." },
        { "cell": "ampersand", "text": "Kenneth Henry Miles nɔ agbe ƒé (1 November 1918 &#x2013; 17 August 1966) eye wonye Eŋlisi lame sé ɖikeke ʋu ɖanu ɖɔwɔla kple ʋu kula si ƒe ŋkɔ ɖi hoo le eƒe fefe mɔ kuku le Amerika dukɔ kple Amerika habɔbɔ si ƒe ŋkɔ ɖi hoo le xexea me katã. Wo da asi ɖe edzi be woanɔ Motorsports Hall of Fame of America habɔbɔ me." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Tanke dzi le Ilorin, Kwara State; 7.30pm Radio Nigeria,Harmony 103.5 FM. Idofian" },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Sukuvi le Southern Methodist Yunivɛsiti le Dallas, eɖu dzi le NCAA ƒe ʋiʋliwo me le ƒe 1999, 2000 kple 2001 me. Esi wònɔ ho ʋlim na Athlé 78 vaseɖe ƒe 1995, emegbe Racing Club de France tso ƒe 1996 va ɖo ƒe 2004, emegbe CA Montreuil 93 le ƒe 1995 ƒe nuwuwu, ekpɔ ɣeyiɣi ɖedzesi aɖe le ƒe 1999 me esi wòɖu Hammer Throw dzi le ƒe 1999 Europa Championships U23s, le Gothenburg, si ƒe duƒuƒu nye meta 64.56. Eɖo Franseawo ƒe amegãwo ƒe nuŋlɔɖi zi gbɔ zi ade le Hammer Throw me: 56.52m 8 Siamlɔm 1995 le Bondoufle, 57.74m 29 Masa 1996 le Montgeron, 58.28m 31 Siamlɔm 1996 le Lamballe, 65.15m kple 65.41m 20 Tedoxe 1999 le Austin (Texas) . kple 66.13m 7 Dame 1999 le Denton." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Le ƒe 2001 me la, exɔ Sika Medalẽ le Mediterranea Kamedefefewo me, eye wòɖo Xexeame Katã ƒe Hoʋiʋli ƒe nuwuwu le Edmonton (7 lia). Le ƒe si kplɔe ɖo me la, exɔ enelia le Europa Hoʋiʋli me le Munich eye wòɖo hurl nyuitɔ kekeake le eƒe agbe me (68.03m)." },
        { "cell": "version-dot", "text": "Esi wònye dukɔmevi eve le esi ta la, (Franco-Togosetɔ), eɖoe be yeaʋli ho ɖe ye dedukɔ ta le ƒe 2005 ƒe ɣeyiɣia ƒe nuwuwu.Exɔ nɔƒe adrelia le Francophony ƒe Fefewo me, eye wòxɔ nɔƒe etɔ̃lia le Togo teƒe le ƒe 2007 ƒe Afrika Katã ƒe Kamedefefewo me esi wòxɔ medalẽ didiƒe si nye meta 59.55 (195 ft 4 in), gake wona klosalo medalẽa esi woɖe Funke Adeyoye si nɔ nɔƒe evelia la ɖa le esi wodoe kpɔ be dɔlélea le eŋu le atike muame dodokpɔ me vɔ megbe. Emegbe exɔ nɔƒe etɔ̃lia le ƒe 2007 Afrika Kamedefefewo me, evelia le ƒe 2008 Afrika Kamedefefewo me, emegbe exɔ nɔƒe etɔ̃lia le Afrika Kamedefefe siwo kplɔe ɖo me, le ƒe 2010. Exɔ Togo ƒe nuŋlɔɖi le Hammer Throw (62.75m) me." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Kaka ƒe 2022 naɖo la, Russia dze aʋa blibo aɖe gɔme kple Ukraine to fefewɔvi \"Donetsk People's Republic\" dzi, si dzi Moscow kpɔ ŋusẽ ɖo bliboe to Russia dunyahela Alexander Boroday dzi. Le ƒe 2022 me la, wowu ame geɖe siwo tsi tre ɖe aʋawɔwɔ ŋu le Russia. Le Ukraine la, Russia le aʋawɔwɔ nuvlowɔwɔ gãwo wɔm, abe bɔmbdada ɖe amewo ƒe nɔƒewo, dugãwo abe Mariupol ene tsɔtsrɔ̃, kple nuvlowɔwɔ ɖe dumevi dzrowo ŋu be woatsɔ ade dzesi tsitretsiɖeŋulawo ahate wo ɖe to, siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye ɖeviwo léle sesẽe kple wo ɖeɖe le dukɔa me. Nuvlowɔwɔ vɔ̃ɖitɔ kekeake si wowɔ ɖe dumevi dzrowo ŋu le Ukraine enye amewuwu si dzɔ le Bucha le March 2022 me. Le anyigbamama siwo woxɔ me la, Russiatɔwo dze Ukrainetɔwo ƒe agbalẽwo tsɔtsrɔ̃ gɔme le sukuwo, blemanudzraɖoƒewo, kple agbalẽdzraɖoƒewo, eye wowɔ nusi woyɔna be \"filtration camps\" afisi wodea dumevi dzrowo gaxɔ me hewɔa funyafunya wo le ." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Burkina Faso enye Afrika dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Afrika ƒe ɣetoɖoƒe lɔƒo. Edo liƒo kple Côte d'Ivoire, Ghana, Togo kpakple Benin le eƒe anyigbe lɔƒo, Niger le eƒe ɣedzeƒe lɔƒo, kple Mali le eƒe dzigbe. Dukɔ sia ƒe ŋkɔ xoxoa enye Dahomey. Burkina Faso ƒe dugã enye Ouagadougou. Gbe si wogblɔna le dɔwɔƒewo enye Fransegbe." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Liberia nye Afrika dukɔwo dometɔawo ɖeka. Ele Afrika ƒe ɣetoɖoƒe lɔƒo. Edo liƒo kple Côte d'Ivoire, Guinea kpakple Sierra Leone. Aƒu si woyɔna be la le eƒe ɣetoɖoƒe lɔƒo." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Le Australia la, woɖua Father's Day alo Tɔwo ƒe ŋkeke le ɣleti sia ƒe Kɔsiɖagbe gbãtɔ dzi." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Founder's Day (Skout Habɔbɔ (UK)) (Dzodze 22)" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "\"Finland's Day\" le Finland dze Damɛ 12lia dzi." },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Dukɔ zã (China, People's Republic of) - Kele 1" },
        { "cell": "quote-letter", "text": "Kotoka nɔ ŋgɔ na asrafowo si ɣlẽ Ghana dziɖuɖua tso Nkrumah ƒe Convention People's Party dziɖuɖua dzi." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "In May 2018, Akunyili Crosby set a new personal auction record with the sale of her painting Bush Babies for nearly $3.4 million at Sotheby's New York." },
        { "cell": "scaled-currency", "text": "Dziɖuɖua do ŋugbe hã be yeana €200 miliɔn. Woazã ga sia atsɔ fia nu amewo tso kluvinyenye ŋu, ade gomekpɔkpɔ le eme ƒe dzi ƒo, eye woakpɔ alesi kluvinyenye gakpɔtɔ le ŋusẽ kpɔm ɖe amewo dzi egbea gbɔ. Wole ɖoɖo wɔm ɖe wɔna aɖe hã ŋu le July 1, 2023 dzi, be woatsɔ ɖo ŋku kluvinyenye ƒe ŋutinya dzi kple dukɔwo abe Dutch Caribbean dukɔwo kple Suriname ene." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Dasiamime 24-Anyɔnyɔ 2 - Woawɔ 2007 xexeame katã ƒe Athletics ɖikeke le Osaka, Japan." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "Edgar de Wahl (23-Agudzɔwo 1867 - 9-Masa 1948) la dzi Baltic Germanwo meɖeaɖea, mathematicianwo lɔ̃xɔ̃wo, akɔ̃wo nu tsofɛ a, ame a kple Interlingue, eƒe ɖo yi a lɔ̃xɔ̃wo na Occidental, kple eye ŋuɖɔ wó." },
        { "cell": "ordinal-caps", "text": "6,7-Dimethyl-8-ribityllumazine nye riboflavin ƒe ŋgɔdonya. Riboflavin synthase wɔa dɔ ɖe edzi." }
    ],

    // The representative tier. Uniform stride over the same segments; keep it alongside the hard-set.
    "sample": [
        "Biblia nye Yudatɔwo, Kristotɔwo ƒe hame vovoawo kpakple ha si woyɔna be \"Eastern Orthodox\" hame le yevugbe me la ƒe agbalẽ vevietɔ na subɔsubɔ. Vovototo suea ɖewo le hasiawo ƒe Bibliawo me.",
        "kasahorow Eʋegbe nyameɖeɖe ɖe gbe bubuwo me",
        "Gana nye Afrika dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Ele Afrika ƒe ɣetoɖoƒe lɔƒo. Gana do liƒo kple Togo kple, Nyiɖu Ƒuta kpakple Burkina Faso. Aƒu si woyɔna be Gulf of Guinea la le eƒe anyiehe lɔƒo. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo lɔƒo (2016).",
        "Le xexeame ƒe dukɔa ɖe wo me la, wonyina avuwo na ɖuɖu. Yuroptɔwo kpakple Amerikatɔwo bua avuwo ɖe aƒemelãwo me ko. Vietnamtɔwo hã, wonyina avuwo na ɖuɖu kpakple aƒeme nɔnɔ katã.",
        "Jerry John Rawlings si wodzi Masa 22, 1947 me, nye Ghana asrafomegã, yameʋukula, kple dunyahela si kplɔ dukɔa kpuie le ƒe 1979 me eye emegbe tso ƒe 1981 va se ɖe ƒe 2001 me. Exɔ ŋgɔ na asrafowo ƒe dziɖuɖu vaseɖe ƒe 1993 me eye emegbe wòwɔ dɔ zi eve abe Ghana ƒe dukplɔla si woti le demokrasimɔ nu ene. Eyae nye kplɔla si nɔ anyi ɣeyiɣi didi wu le Ghana ƒe ŋutinya me, eye wòɖu dukɔa dzi ƒe 19 sɔŋ. Etrɔ megbe le Adeɛmekpɔxe 12, 2020 me.",
        "Siamlɔm 20 - Ɖokuisinɔnɔ Ŋkeke (Colombia)",
        "Laksembɔg (Lëtzebuerg) nye Europa dukɔwo dometɔ ɖeka. Laksembɔg ƒe dugã enye Luxembourg City.",
        "Dasiamime 15 - Bahrain, India, North Korea, kple South Korea",
        "Wodzii le Gwollu, si nye kɔƒea ɖe le Sisalla West District le Upper West nutome le Ghana gbegãdzi. Le eƒe ɖevi me la, eƒe tɔgbuiŋkɔ enye Babini. Ede ŋgɔ le suku eye wòwɔ dɔ gãwo hafi vayi zu Ghana dukplɔla.",
        "Kɔsiɖagbe enye ŋkeke si le Memleɖagbe kple Dzoɖagbe dome. Kristotɔwo tsɔe abe ŋkeke gbãtɔ le kɔsiɖaa me. Yuropatɔwo bue abe ŋkeke mamlea le kɔsiɖaa me.",
        "International Standard Bible Encyclopedia Vol. 1(Eŋlisigbe)",
        "Yawoɖagbe le Blugbe me enye Yawoada si de sɔsɔ gbe kple Eʋegbe tɔ. Le Yuropa duwo geɖe me la, Yawoɖagbe enye ŋkeke enelia le kɔsiɖaa me.",
        "Nyɔnuwo le xexeame godo ƒe ŋkeke (Tedoxe 8)",
        "Afrika dukɔ aɖe siwo doa Eŋlisigbe lawoe nye Eritrea, Eswatini, Gambia, Ghana, Kenya , Lezoto, Liberia, Malawi, Namibia, Nigeria, Rwanda, South Africa, South Sudan, Sudan, Tanzania, Uganda, Zambia, Zimbabwe.",
        "Ɖokuisinɔnɔ Ŋkeke le the Republic Of Cyprus Kele 1",
        "Ŋkɔ Yehowa (alo Yahweh, abe alesi Roma Katoliko ƒe Jerusalem Bible kple agbalẽnyala aɖewo yɔnɛ ene la) dze zi gbɔ zi 7,000 le Hebri Ŋɔŋlɔawo me. Womedee Biblia akpa gãtɔ me alea o, ke boŋ wotsɔ “Mawu” alo “Aƒetɔ” ɖo eteƒe. Gake le Biblia siawo me gɔ̃ hã la, woate ŋu akpɔ afisi wozã Yehowa le le Hebrigbe me kpukpuiawo me elabena ŋɔŋlɔdzesigãwo ƒe lolotɔwo kple suetɔwoe wotsɔ ŋlɔa nya siwo wotsɔ ɖo ŋkɔa teƒee, si nye: MAWU kple AƑETƆ. Egbegbe gɔmeɖeɖe geɖe zã ŋkɔ Yehowa alo Yahweh. Eyata Yesaya 42:8 xlẽ le Eʋegbe Biblia me be, “Nyee nye Yehowa, ŋkɔnyee.”",
        "Yakob (יַעֲקֹב) nye Isak ƒe vi wodometɔwo ɖeka. Eƒe ŋkɔ evelia enye Israel. Yakob kple Isau wo nye venɔviwo eye wo nɔ enye Rebeka.",
        "Reykjavík nye Iceland dugã enye. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 119.845 lɔƒo (2009).",
        "Kotoka International Airport, (IATA:ACC, ICAO:DGAA) Ghana dukɔa ƒe ayameʋu dzeƒe gã tɔwu le afisia, eye wotrɔ ŋkɔaɔ zu Kotoka International Airport hetsɔ ɖo ŋku Kotoka dzi.",
        "Bydgoszcz nye kɔƒe sue aɖe le Poland dukɔa me. Eƒe dukɔmenɔlawo ƒe xexlẽme ɖo 357,652 (2014) lɔƒo.",
        "Ako be ne meɖi ʋu o hã, kpɔ ye ƒe ble me ɖa.",
        "Waakye si woateŋu aɖu le ɖe ŋdi alo ŋdɔ nuɖuɖu teƒe. Wo ɖua waakye kple nudonui siawo dometɔ ɖeka alo wo ƒe agbɔsɔsɔme, kelewele, akpa tɔtɔ, abladzo tɔtɔ, koklozi ɖaɖa, koklola tɔtɔ.",
        "Do nugododeƒe or afɔdzidedo nye nugodo deƒe aɖe si lɔa amemi ɖe do si woɖe ɖe anyigba la. Mezana tsi o loo alo liter de etɔ ko atsɔ tutu mi la woadzo to ekɔkɔ ɖe miadzi me. Ne wotui nyuie eye wole be nɛ ha nyuie la woateŋu aɖe dɔlekuiwomama dzi kpɔtɔ to afɔdzi si le anyi gbadzaa la to nugodo dede ɖe anyi gbadzaa me. Esia ɖea dɔlekuiwo mama le nugodo kple nuɖuɖu tso nudzodzuiwo gbɔ kpɔtɔna. Dɔlekui siawo koŋ nana afɔdzidededɔ si mana bɔbɔe kple ŋɔviwo le dɔkaviwo me dɔ. Afɔdzidededɔ si mana bɔbɔe la hea ku vɛ na ɖevi siwo mexɔ ƒe atɔ o la si de million 0.7 le ƒe 2011 eye wobu million 250 suku ŋkekewo. Do nugododeƒewo nye mɔnu si dzi woato ama mi tso amewo gbɔ.",
        "Tsaxewo ɖua nudzodzoewo kple nukuwo abe bli ene. Wo ɖi tegliwo gake fũ mele woƒe tame o. Tsaxewo tsana le lã bubuwo abe kesewo yome ene. Wo nye xe siwo ateŋu adzo ŋutɔ. Wo dometɔ aɖe wo ateŋu anɔ agbe tsi manomanoe ne tsi le vevem.",
        "Ampetulawo tia kpo zi 2eka sia akpe he2ea wo5e af4 2eka 2e `g4. Ne ampetula si nye kpl4la la kple ame si wole ampea tum kplii la 2e af4 2eka la, enyea dzesi 2eka na kpl4la la. Ke ne wo2e af4 vovovowo la, ame si le ampea tum kple kpl4la la zua dzi2ula hetr4 zuna kpl4la la. Ne ampetulawo 2e hafi le amp1a tum la, kpl4la la tua ampe la hez4na to ame mamleawo dzi 2eka2ekae. Ne fli me wole h7 la, kpl4la la tua ampea kple ame sia ame si le flia me. Ke ne ampetulawo nye eve ko la, woxl8a dzesi eye ame si 5e dzesi s4gb4 wu lae zua dzi2ula.",
        "Le ƒe 1993 kple 2015, wo wɔ tɔtrɔ yeyewo le agbale sike de megbe na sitsoƒe ƒe gomekpɔkpɔ ŋu. le enya sia wo nkume kude sitsofe dzilawo ƒe kuxiwo nu le ƒe 2015 ƒe akpa evelia me.",
        "Le GTZ ƒe nuŋɔŋlɔ me la, ame agbɔ sɔsɔ geɖe wo nye mɔzɔla siwo le Germany mɔzɔgbale de asi. Wo ame sia wo zɔ mɔ kple agbalɛ deditɔwo gake wo me gbugbɔ yi woƒe tsoƒewo o, ke boŋ le Germany le esime wo me ŋlɔ ŋkɔ be yewo anɔ anyi awu ŋkeke si wo na wo la o.",
        "Miles nye amesi \"xɔ ŋkɔreputation le bubudeameŋu mɔ dzi\" eye wo woyɔnɛ be \"Stirling Moss of the West Coast\". Esi wonɔ kple AC-Cobra Ford Haboboa la, Miles geɖe Lotus 23 me le ƒé 1964 Player's 200 le Mosport.",
        "Dayan Kodua (wodzi le Anyɔnyɔ 7, 1980) nye Ghana dzidzimevi si nye Dzamanya fefewɔla, agbalẽŋlɔla kple kpɔɖeŋunɔ. Le ƒe 2001 me la, ezu nyɔnu yibɔ gbãtɔ si ɖu dzi le atsyɔ̃ɖoɖo ƒe hoʋiʋli aɖe me le Dzamanya. Ewɔ akpa vevi geɖewo le Amerika kple Dzamanya sinimawo me eye wotiae be wòanye amedɔdɔ na Afrika-nyigbagã le Dzamanya le ƒe 2005 me.",
        "Ada Ameh (15 Dame 1974 – 17 Siamlɔm 2022) nye Nigeriatɔ fefewɔla si zã ƒe blaeve kple edzivɔ le Nigeria sinimawɔƒe eye wòɖe dzesi wu le eƒe nɔnɔme abe Anita ene le ƒe 1996 sinima si ƒe tanyae nye Domitilla me kple abe Emu Johnson ene le sinima si xɔ kafukafu me Nigeriatɔwo ƒe television dzi wɔna siwo ƒe tanyae nye The Johnsons. Ameh le The Johnsons television dzi wɔnawo me la, woɖee fia kpe ɖe Nollywood fefewɔla bubuwo abe Charles Inojie, Chinedu Ikedieze, kple Olumide Oworu ŋu.",
        "Adoboli ʋu yi Switzerland le ƒe 2002. Eƒo nuƒo vevi aɖe na Xexeame ƒe Yame ƒe Nɔnɔme Ŋuti Habɔbɔ le Afɔfiɛ 2010 me, eye wòde dzi ƒo na habɔbɔa be wòana yame ƒe nɔnɔme ŋuti nyatakakawo kple yame ƒe nɔnɔme ŋuti dɔwɔnawo nanyo ɖe edzi na Afrikatɔwo kple dziɖuɖuwo be woaɖe dzɔdzɔmefɔku siwo yame ƒe nɔnɔme ƒe tɔtrɔ hena vɛ ƒe ŋusẽkpɔɖeamedziwo dzi akpɔtɔ. Adoboli ƒoe ɖe Afrika dukɔwo nu be woaƒo ƒu akpɔ yame ƒe nɔnɔme ŋuti nya siwo gbɔna la gbɔ. Le ƒe 2011 me la, wotsɔ nya ɖe eŋu be egblẽ CFA franc miliɔn 800 le xɔtudɔ aɖe me le Lome le ƒe 1999 me esime wònye dukplɔlagã. Woɖoe be kplɔlawo nazã aƒe gãwo le Afrika Ðekawɔwɔ Habɔbɔ ƒe takpekpe aɖe me. Le Siamlɔm 2011 me la, enye ame etɔ̃ siwo wotso afia na be woanɔ gaxɔ me ƒe atɔ̃ le woƒe anyimanɔmanɔ me le akpa si wòwɔ le ga la dada me ta la dometɔ ɖeka. Adoboli gbe nutsotsoa, eye wògblɔ be, \"Ɣeyiɣi aɖeke meli si nyemenyrɔ ɖokuinye ɖe Togo dziɖuɖua ƒe akɔntabubuwo me o. Ʋɔnudɔdrɔ̃ sia do liƒo kple fewuɖulawo eye mede bubu míaƒe dukɔa ŋu o.\" Ke boŋ ete tɔ ɖe edzi be Togo nyi fe le ye ŋu.",
        "Wodzi Yabo le Porto-Novo, Benin, le Tedoxe 13, 1925. Eyae nye Frédéric Jol Avo fofo.",
        "Abloh nye atsyãwɔƒe si nye Off-White si le Milan,",
        "Suad Ibrahim Abdi nye nyɔnuwo ƒe gomenɔamesi taʋlila tso Somaliland.",
        "Akolle wɔ dɔ kple Center for Policy Analysis (CEPA) si nye",
        "Eyae nye Polycom Development Project, si naa ŋusẽ nyɔnuviwo kple ɖetugbuiwo le Kibera xɔmanyamanyawo me la ɖola kple edzikpɔla.",
        "Switzerland ƒe Ablɔɖe Kple Amegbetɔ ƒe Gomenɔamesiwo Ŋuti",
        "Le dukɔa ƒe bɔlƒoha me la, eva zu Europa ʋiʋlidziɖula le ƒe 2022",
        "me tso ƒe alafa blaevelia ƒe gɔmedzedze, do ŋgɔ na Xexemeʋa I,",
        "Hadizatou Mani (wodzi le ƒe 1984 me)nye amegbetɔ ƒe",
        "Wodzi T. B. Macaulay le Kissy, Sierra Leone le January 17, 1826 dzi, eye dzila siwo nye Yorubatɔ siwo",
        "Aboubakar Soumahoro (wodzi le 6 Masa 1980) nye Italy-Ivory Coast dɔwɔlawo ƒe habɔbɔ me tɔ,",
        "be wòanye mɔ si dzi woato ade nyɔnuwo ŋutifafa kple dedienɔnɔ",
        "Le ƒe 1995 me la, woɖoe Uganda Ʋɔnudrɔ̃ƒe Kɔkɔtɔ ƒe ʋɔnudrɔ̃la kpɔ.",
        "Cynthia Akanga nye Togo-Franse ɣeɖula, ɣeɖula, aɖaŋudɔwo",
        "Amedokpo zãa ami siwo le nutoa me tsɔ taa nu eye eƒe avɔwo nye wɔkotoku siwo",
        "Wotia Agbemadon be wòanye RPT Titinakɔmiti me tɔ tso Yoto Nutome le akpahaa ƒe Takpekpe 9 lia me le Dzome 2006 me.",
        "Gad Ami nye ŋkɔ bubu na Amivi Gadegbeku (wodzi le ƒe 1958), Fransegbe me agbalẽŋlɔla tso Togo. Eyae nye nyɔnu agbalẽŋlɔla gbãtɔ le Togo.",
        "Eƒoa bɔl abe pitcher ene. Wonyae nyuie wu le esi wòƒo bɔl na Los",
        "Wonyae ɖe eƒe asitsadɔwɔwɔ le Fiat ta. Esi wònye Fiat ƒe tatɔ ta la, ekpɔ ŋusẽ ɖe Italy ƒe GDP ƒe 4.4% dzi.",
        "Attipoé nye RPT ƒe ametiakɔdala Faure Gnassingbé ƒe akɔdada ƒe",
        "Wota eƒe agbalẽ yeyetɔ kekeake si nye Mina parmi les ombres le ƒe 2018 ƒe adame.",
        "Wodzi Samuel Johnson Creoletɔ si gbugbɔ xɔ ŋkɔ le Freetown, Sierra Leone, wònye Henry Erugunjinmi Johnson kple Sarah Johnson ƒe vi adre dometɔ etɔ̃lia le June 24, 1846. Wodzi fofoa, si tsɔ Yoruba ŋkɔ Erugunjinmi na eɖokui la, le ƒe 1810 me le dua me ƒe Oyo-Ile, si nye Oyo Fiaɖuƒea ƒe fiadu. Henry nye Omoba (fiavi) si tso Oyo-ƒomea me, eye wònye ƒe alafa 18 lia me alaafin (fia) Abiodun ƒe tɔgbuiyɔvi.Emegbe wolée le",
        "Edze eƒe sukudede gɔme le Christ Church Gɔmedzesuku, Porogun Ijebu-Ode le ƒe 1912 me eye emegbe wòde Ijebu Ode Gbeŋutise Suku.",
        "Abigail Adams ʋli hehe si sɔ le dukɔa ƒe sukuwo me na ŋutsuviwo kple nyɔnuviwo ta. Le eƒe ɖevime la, eƒe lãme mesẽna zi geɖe o. Ezãa eƒe ɣeyiɣi akpa gãtɔ tsɔ xlẽa nu. Tsɔ kpe ɖe eŋu la, eŋlɔa lɛta na eƒe ƒometɔwo kple xɔlɔ̃wo hafi ɖe srɔ̃.",
        "Monroe nye dukplɔla tso ƒe 1817 va ɖo ƒe 1825. Monroe kple eƒe Dudɔnunɔla John Quincy Adams na Spain tsɔ Florida na United States. Monroe kple Adams hã to Monroe Nufiafia vɛ, si nye ɖoɖo si gblɔ be United States medi be Europa nakpɔ gome le Ɣetoɖoƒenutowo me azɔ o.",
        "Le ƒe 1789 me la, woti Washington be wòanye dukplɔla hoʋiʋli aɖeke manɔmee, si wɔe be wòzu United States ƒe Dukplɔla gbãtɔ. Togbɔ be Washington menye dunyaheha aɖeke me tɔ o hã la, elɔ̃ ɖe Federalist Party ƒe ɖoɖo aɖewo dzi, abe alesi wòle be asrafoha si le tsitrenu kple dukɔa ƒe gadzraɖoƒe nanɔ dukɔa me ene. Wogatiae ake be wòanye zimenɔɣi evelia. Le eƒe zimenɔɣi evelia megbe la, Washington tso nya me be yemagaʋli ho ake o, togbɔ be amewo ƒe nu lé dzi nɛ gakpɔtɔ le dzidzim ɖe edzi hã. Eƒe nyametsotso, be yeadzudzɔ zimenɔɣi 2, ɖo kpɔɖeŋu si dzi dukplɔla ɖesiaɖe zɔ ɖo vaseɖe esime Franklin D. Roosevelt nava le ƒe 1940 me.",
        "Wodzi Harrison le Dzodze 9, 1773. Enye Benjamin Harrison V kple Elizabeth Bassett ƒe vi adreawo dometɔ suetɔ. Wonɔ Berkeley Agbledeƒe si le Charles City County, Virginia. Eyae nye dukplɔla mamlɛtɔ si wodzi abe Britain dukɔmevi ene do ŋgɔ na Amerikatɔwo ƒe Ðokuisinɔɣi. Fofoa nye agbledela kple amedɔdɔ le Anyigbagã dzi Sewɔtakpekpe (ƒe 1774–1777) si de asi Ðokuisinɔamesi ƒe Gbeƒãɖeɖe te. Enye Virginia ƒe Nutomedziɖula le ƒe 1781 kple 1784 dome. Wotia nɔviaŋutsu tsitsitɔ Carter Bassett Harrison be manye Virginia teƒenɔla le United States Teƒenɔlawo ƒe Aƒea me.",
        "Wodzi Dominique Strauss-Kahn le April 25, 1949 dzi le",
        "Bastiani nye Auterive ƒe Dumegã le ƒe 1989 vaseɖe ƒe 2008 dome eye wògaganye tso ƒe",
        "Dukplɔla kple France ƒe Dukplɔsedzikpɔha me tɔ ƒe",
        "le Bayonne, Pyrénées-Atlantiques le kuxi siwo dona",
        "Hammel ku le 6 Dzove 2021 esime wòxɔ ƒe 70.[1]",
        "ƒe 2007 me la, enye Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ na",
        "2014 me la, Baeumler nye Dumegã le Thann, Haut-Rhin. Tso ƒe 1988 va ɖo ƒe 1993 kple ƒe 1997 va ɖo",
        "Le March 3, 2020 dzi la, Bertrand ku le Mende le",
        "Enye dudzikpɔla le Sotteville-lès-Rouen, Seine-",
        "Bazin ku le 17 April 2020 le Dijon, xɔ ƒe 77.",
        "dunyahela. Wodzii le Tours, Indre-et-Loire. Bouvard nyeFrance Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ.[1] Enɔ Morbihan dɔwɔƒea",
        "sidzenu adelia: eƒe nuŋɔŋlɔ si nye Physiognomie.na eƒe tɔɖiayɔvi dzetugbe Juliette Récamier xlẽ",
        "philippe Daverio (17 October 1949 – 2 September 2020) nye Francetɔ si wodzi le",
        "Nyatakaka-Pilote xexlẽdzesi 612, Paris, Nyatakaka-Pilote, March 2007",
        "Woxɔe le Bordeaux Masonic Lodge La Française le ƒe 1773 me eye wònye eƒe bubutɔ tegbee tso ƒe 1779 me.",
        "Le ema megbe la, le ƒe 1998 me la, enye Toulouse Dumegã",
        "Le February 2020 me la, Son-Forget ɖe gbeƒã eƒe ametiakɔdada na France ƒe Dukplɔla le ƒe 2022 ƒe tiatiawɔɣi.[4] Gake emegbe edzudzɔ sukudede eye wòdo alɔ Éric Zemmour ƒe aʋawɔwɔ si medze edzi o.[5]",
        "marielle de Sarnez (Fransegbe me: [ma.ʁjɛl də saʁ.nɛz] ; 27 Dzove 1951 – 13 Dzove 2021) nye Franse dunyahela. Enye Demokrasihabɔbɔa me tɔ. Le ƒe 2017 me la, woti De Sarnez be wòanye Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ.",
        "edgard Pisani (Fransegbe: [pizani]; 9 October 1918 – 20 June 2016) nye Franse dukplɔla, xexemenunyala, kple agbalẽŋlɔla.",
        "roland Chassain (5 Dzove 1947 – 9 Dzove 2021) nye Franse dunyahela. Wodzii le Aurillac, France. Chassain nye Rally for the Republic me tɔ. Tso ƒe 2002 va ɖo ƒe 2007 me la, enye Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ. Tso ƒe 1995 vaseɖe eƒe kugbe la, enye Saintes-Maries-de-la-Mer ƒe Dumegã.",
        "jean-Marie Girault (9 Dzove 1926 – 1 May 2016) nye Franse dunyahela. Ewɔ dɔ abe Caen ƒe dudzikpɔla tso ƒe 1970 va ɖo ƒe 2001. Enye Franseawo ƒe Demokrasi Habɔbɔ me tɔ. Wodzi Girault le Pont-l’Évêque, France.",
        "Le ƒe 1994 me la, woɖoe Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika Ŋgɔyidɔwo ƒe Gadzraɖoƒe (BOAD), si nye nutome gadzikpɔƒe aɖe si le Lomé, Togo, ƒe Dukplɔla. Enɔ ɖoƒe sia vaseɖe ƒe 2006. Le eƒe zimenɔɣi eve siwo wònɔ BOAD ƒe tatɔ me la, Yayi kpɔ dzidzedze le Gadzraɖoƒea ƒe dɔdzikpɔkpɔ ƒe ɖoɖo yeye wɔwɔ me eye wòhe gomenɔla yeyewo vɛ le xexeame katã (India, China, kple bubuawo), si na be ŋgɔyiyidɔwo va le dzidzim ɖe edzi le dukɔ 8 siwo nye Benin, Burkina Faso, Côte d’Ivoire, Guinea Bissau, Mali, Niger, Senegal kple Togo.",
        "Seul ŋkume à la dzɔdzɔenyenye américaine, ed. Plon, ƒe 2007",
        "Egbe nya siwo wogblɔ tso Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpea ɖeɖeɖa si gbɔna ŋu.",
        "Dɔdzikpɔla tso January 4, 1988 vaseɖe February 4, 1993 le Dukplɔla Clinton ƒe ɣeyiɣi si nye Dudzikpɔla.",
        "matthew Hassan Kukah (wodzi le 31 Dasiamime 1952) nye bisiɔp fifia le Roma Katoliko Saɖaganutome le Sokoto.",
        "Charles Powell Adams (March 3, 1831 – November 2, 1893 nye Aʋafiagã le Union Army, atikewɔla kple dunyahela.",
        "samuel Adebayo Abe nye Anglikan Bisiɔp le Ekiti le ƒe 2007 me, le Ondo Nutome le Nigeria Sɔlemeha la me.",
        "Woɖoe Ekiti ƒe Bisiɔp le ƒe 1998 me, le Samuel Akinbola ƒe dzudzɔxɔxɔledɔme megbe. Wogatiae zi evelia be wòanye Ondo ƒe Bisiɔpgã le ƒe 2007 me.",
        "Wodzi Agbaje le June 12, 1937 dzi le Ikare. Eyi Victory College, Ikare, eye wòwu Immanuel College of Theology, Kudeti-Ibadan nu le ƒe 1963 me.",
        "Exɔ BA le Eŋlisigbe me (ƒe 1973) kple MA (Eŋlisigbe me nusɔsrɔ̃) le ƒe 1978 me le IFE Yunivɛsiti kple PhD (Eŋlisigbe me gbe) tso Sheffield Yunivɛsiti, England (1980). Ajulo wɔ dɔ le yunivɛsiti siwo gbɔna me: Ambrose Alli, Ahmadu Bello, kple Jos Yunivɛsiti (afisi wòzu nufialagã le le ƒe 1995 me).",
        "Funkuro Godrules Amgbare nye Anglikan bisiɔp le Nigeria: enye Dziehe Izon ƒe Bisiɔp fifia ame enyi siwo le Anglikan Nutome le Niger Delta dometɔ ɖeka, eya ŋutɔ hã nye ame 14 siwo le Nigeria Sɔlemeha la me la dometɔ ɖeka.",
        "Enye Zaria ƒe Bisiɔp vaseɖe ƒe 2017 me esime wòxɔ dzudzɔ le dɔme eye Abiodun Ogunyemi va xɔ ɖe eteƒe.",
        "Charline Patricia Effah (si wodzi le ƒe 1977 me) nye Gabontɔ agbalẽŋlɔla kple nufiala si le Paris.",
        "Wodzi Ngou le ƒe 1957 me, eye wònye vi wuiɖekɛ ƒe tsitsitɔ. Edzilawo de eƒe sukudede ƒe dzi ƒo, togbɔ be dadaa mede suku kpɔ o eye ƒe eve koe fofoa wu gɔmedzesuku nu hã. Esi wòxɔ ƒe wuiade la, eɖe Albert Ngou, si nye yunivɛsiti sukuvi le Libreville. Esrɔ̃ nu kple srɔ̃a le Libreville, eye esi wòde yunivɛsiti le France le ƒe 1974 me la, eŋlɔ ŋkɔ ɖe Grenoble lycée aɖe me. Esi wòtrɔ yi Gabon kple srɔ̃a le ƒe 1978 me la, ewɔ sukunuwuwu ƒe nusɔsrɔ̃ le Omar Bongo Yunivɛsiti hafi xɔ ɖɔkta ƒe dzeside le France. Kaka ƒe 1985 naɖo la, enye nufialagã le Omar Bongo Yunivɛsiti, eye le ema megbe kpuie la, eva zu Fransegbe ƒe Dɔwɔƒe si le afima ƒe zimenɔla.[1]",
        "Nuŋlɔɖiwo ŋutinyawo sur la mort du duc d’Enghien",
        "Klutse hã le vevie dom nu le dunyahehe me abe Dukɔa ƒe Demokrasihabɔbɔ me tɔ ene.",
        "Oboh-Ikuenobe de St. Maria Goretti Nyɔnuviwo ƒe Gbeŋutise Suku Benin-dugã me, Nigeria. Exɔ BSc gbãtɔ le anyigbaŋutinunya me le ƒe 1983 me, emegbe ewɔ dɔ abe anyigbaŋutinunyala si wɔa nu le Shell Petroleum Development Company of Nigeria le Lagos, kple palynologist le Shell le woƒe anyigbaŋutinunya ƒe nudokpɔƒe le Warri Delta State, hafi trɔ yi sukunuwuwu ƒe suku nɛ MSc le anyigbaŋutinunya si wozãna me le ƒe 1987 me, tso Ife Nigeria Yunivɛsiti (si nye Obafemi Awolowo Yunivɛsiti fifia). Le esia megbe la, exɔ ɖoƒe abe nufiala ƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ ene le Ife Yunivɛsiti. Wotsɔ Commonwealth Scholarship Commission Award nɛ ɖe eƒe ɖɔkta ƒe dzeside le Anyigbaŋutinunya Dɔwɔƒe, Cambridge Yunivɛsiti (New Hall, si nye Murray Edwards College fifia), si wonae le ƒe 1991 me kple eƒe dɔdasi si nye ‘Palaeoenvironmental Reconstruction of the E2.0 Reservoir in the Kolo Creek Agble, Niger-ƒuta (Nigeria)'. Ege ɖe Missouri S&T, si nye Anyigbaŋutinunya kple Anyigbaŋutinunya Dɔwɔƒe ɣemaɣi le ƒe 1991 me abe nufialagã ƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ le anyigbaŋutinunya me ene.",
        "Hoegh-Guldberg, Mumby, Hooten kple Steneck, « Koral-ƒuwo le Yame ƒe Nɔnɔme ƒe Tɔtrɔ Kabakaba Kple Atsiaƒu ƒe Acidification Te », Dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunya, babla 318, no 5857, 14 decembre 2007, Ƒe axa 1737-1742.",
        "2022 – Goalkeepers Dɔwɔna ƒe Kafukafu, si Bill & Melinda Gates Foundation na",
        "Ðewohĩ numekuku gbãtɔwo le akpa sia me. Taflatse nawɔe wòanyo ɖe edzi to nya siwo wogblɔ la me toto kple nyayɔyɔ siwo le fli me tsɔtsɔ kpee me. Ele be woaɖe nya siwo me numekuku gbãtɔwo ɖeɖeko le ɖa. (February 2021) (Srɔ̃ alesi nàɖe template gbedasi sia ɖa kple ɣeyiɣi si nàɖe ɖa)",
        "Esi John Njue xɔ ƒe wuiatɔ̃ la, ege ɖe Nkubu ƒe mawusubɔsubɔ ƒe suku hafi yi eƒe nusɔsrɔ̃ dzi le Rome afisi wòxɔ ɖɔkta ƒe dzeside le xexemenunya me le ƒe 1966 me le Pontifical Urbaniana Yunivɛsiti emegbe, le ƒe 1974 me la, exɔ ɖɔkta ƒe dzeside le mawunyaŋununya me le Pontifical Lateran Yunivɛsiti.Nusɔsrɔ̃ siawo wɔɣie Papa Paul VI ŋutɔ ɖoe nunɔlae.",
        "Seydou Koné, si nye ƒome aɖe si si vi enyi le ƒe viŋutsu gbãtɔ la, tɔgbuia nyi le nɔnɔme si me wòde dzesii be ele \"hamemetsitsiwo dome\" me. Ele be nɔnɔme sia nakpɔ ŋusẽ ɖe eƒe dɔwɔwɔ dzi vevie. Alpha Blondy ʋu yi Odienné kple fofoa le ƒe 1962. Le ɣeyiɣi sia me la, enye sukuvi le Sainte Elisabeth Sekɛndrisuku eye wònɔ vevie dom nu le Ivory Coast sukuviwo ƒe habɔbɔa me. Le sekɛndrisuku la, enye haƒoha aɖe me tɔ, gake le tɔtɔ si wòhe va eƒe sukudede me ta la, wonyae le suku mlɔeba. Le ƒe 1973 me la, edzilawo wɔ ɖoɖo nɛ be wòade Eŋlisigbe ƒe suku aɖe le Monrovia, si nye Liberia ƒe fiadu. Esi wònɔ afima ɣleti wuietɔ̃ katã vɔ la, etso nya me mlɔeba be yeaʋu ayi United States be yeƒe Eŋlisigbe nanyo ɖe edzi.",
        "Wodzi Hope eye wonyii le ƒome aɖe si te ɖe Mombasa ŋu me. Eyae nye ame gbãtɔ le eƒe ƒomea me si de yunivɛsiti be yeayi yeƒe suku kɔkɔ dede dzi. Exɔ eƒe BSc le Tsiŋutinunya me le Egerton Yunivɛsiti le ƒe 2010. Le ƒe 2013 me la, ewu Nutomeŋutinunya nu le UNESCO-IHE, si le Netherlands3.",
        "Sembène srɔ̃ nuxexlẽ kple nuŋɔŋlɔ le Fransegbe me le eɖokui si, eye emegbe eɖo ŋu ɖe eƒe agbemenuteƒekpɔkpɔ geɖe ŋu le eƒe agbalẽ gbãtɔ si nye Le Docker Noir (The Black Docker, 1956), si woŋlɔ ɖe Fransegbe me la me. Dɔ sia gblɔ Diaw, si nye Afrikatɔ ʋukula aɖe si doa dzi le nazãbubu kple nuwɔna gbegblẽwo me le tɔdziʋudzeƒewo le Marseille la ƒe ŋutinya. Diaw wɔa agbalẽ aɖe, si nyɔnu yevu aɖe xɔ emegbe eye wòtae ɖe eƒe ŋkɔ te; edze ŋgɔ yevu nyɔnua, ewui le manyamanya me, eye wodrɔ̃ ʋɔnui hewui le nudzɔdzɔ siwo he susu yi Albert Camus ƒe The Stranger (si gɔme woɖe be The Outsider) dzi vevie me. Sembène klo nu le Arab kple Spain dɔwɔlawo ƒe ŋlɔmiwɔwɔ dzi, si na wòdze ƒã be nusiwo ŋu wotsi dzi ɖo la kpɔa ŋusẽ ɖe amedzrowo ƒe fuléle dzi abe alesi wòkpɔa ŋusẽ ɖe ameƒomevinyenye dzii ene. Togbɔ be agbalẽa ƒo nu tso Afrikatɔ siwo ʋu va dukɔ bubuwo me ŋudɔwɔwɔ ŋu koŋ hã la, Sembène ƒo nu tso alesi wotea dɔwɔla siwo tso dukɔ bubuwo me hã ŋu. Woŋlɔe le hadomenudzɔdzɔ ŋutɔŋutɔ ƒe gbeɖiɖi me, abe alesi eƒe agbalẽ bubuawo ƒe akpa gãtɔ le ene. Enye Sembène ƒe ŋkɔxɔxɔ le agbalẽŋɔŋlɔ ƒe gɔmedzedze eye wòna gakpekpeɖeŋu si wòhiã be wòayi edzi anɔ nuŋɔŋlɔ dzi le ema megbe.",
        "Gadjigo, Samba, kple ame bubuwo. Ousmane Sembène: Dzeɖoɖowo Kple Ðeklemiɖelawo Kple Agbalẽŋlɔlawo . Amherst: Massachusetts Yunivɛsiti ƒe Nyadzɔdzɔdɔwɔƒe, 1993.",
        "Kobina Tahir Hammond (wodzi le June 16, 1960) nye Ghana dunyahela. Enye Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ na Adensi-Asokwa nuto si le Ashanti Nutome le Ghana le Ghana Dukɔ 4 lia ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe 3 lia, 4 lia, 5 lia, 6 lia, 7 lia kple 8 lia me. Enye Dukɔlɔ̃lawo ƒe Habɔbɔ Yeyea me tɔ.",
        "Eyi edzi wɔ dɔ abe dɔdzikpɔla ƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ le Dɔwɔƒewo kple Ganyawo me na New York Yunivɛsiti le Ghana le ƒe (2004 kple 2007) dome.",
        "Le ƒe 1938 me, esime Ananda Mahidol xɔ ƒe wuietɔ̃ la, eyi Siam zi gbãtɔ abe eƒe fia ene. Dadaa kple nɔviaŋutsu suetɔ, Bhumibol Adulyadej, kpe ɖe fia la ŋu le eƒe sasrãkpɔa me. Field Marshal Plaek Phibunsongkhram nye dukplɔlagã ɣemaɣi kple le Ananda Mahidol ƒe dziɖuɣi gãtɔ me.",
        "Mawuli Suku nye sɛkɛndri suku si le Ho le Ho Dudzikpɔƒe nuto me le Amugã Nutome le Ghana .",
        "Eƒe taɖodzinu hãe nye be yeaɖe ahedada dzi akpɔtɔ eye yeado ŋusẽ hadomekadodo, si na wòdo go dɔwɔlawo kple dɔwɔlawo le eƒe nuto si me wotso, Atakpamé.",
        "Edzia ha le gbegbɔgblɔ geɖe me, siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye Eʋegbe,",
        "Ewɔ eƒe sinima kpui si nye Le Dilemme d’Eya le ƒe 2002. UNESCO ye wɔ sinima sia eye wòna adaŋudeha ƒe fetu tɔxɛ eve: Union Economique et Monétaire Ouest Africaine (UEMOA) kple Plan International le Panafrican Film and Television Festival of Ouagadougou (FESPACO). Le Dame 2003 me la, wotia sinima sia be woaɖee afia le Dukɔwo Dome Dudɔnunɔlawo ƒe Television Takpekpe (INPUT) me.",
        "2020: Tube of the Year 2019 Trophy na The Heroes 228 ɖe eƒe hadzidzi Mawu Bé Sekreter ta.",
        "Victoire Sidémého Dzidudu Dogbé Tomegah (wodzi le 23 Bold textDecember 1959) nye Togo dunyahela si nye Togo ƒe dukplɔlagã tso 28 September 2020. Eyae nye nyɔnu gbãtɔ si xɔ dɔa.",
        "Wodzii le 28 January 1977 dzi eye wòtso Chereponi le Dzieheɣedzeƒe nuto me le Ghana. Exɔ eƒe gɔmedzesuku le ƒe 1992 me eye wòxɔ eƒe SSSCE le ƒe 1995 me.",
        "In 2020, he lost the bid to lead the New Patriotic Party going into the parliamentary elections to Davis Ansah Opoku. Ele subɔsubɔm fifia abe Ɣedzeƒe Nutome ƒe subɔla ene.",
        "Yawa Kouigan nye Ifodje Bɔlƒoha si le Atakpamé ƒe zimenɔla hã. Exɔ ɖe UNIR ƒe sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ Michel Amétodji teƒe le ɖoƒe sia le mamlɛtɔa ƒe asiɖeɖe le dɔ ŋu megbe.",
        "Dadzie va ge ɖe Gold Coast ƒe dutadɔnunɔlawo ƒe dɔ me le ƒe 1952. Eyi dɔa dzi esi Ghana va zu dukɔ si le eɖokui si le ƒe 1957. Exɔ ɖoƒe geɖe le subɔsubɔdɔa me eye woɖoe ɖe ɖoƒe kɔkɔwo le Dukɔ Ƒoƒuawo ƒe Agbalẽŋlɔƒe le Geneva kple New York siaa. Ewɔ dɔ hã abe Ghana teƒenɔla Tegbee le Dukɔ Ƒoƒuawo ƒe Dɔwɔƒe si le Geneva. Le dziɖuɣi ma me la, eganye Ghana ƒe dudɔnunɔla le Austria kple Switzerland. Jerry Rawlings ye tiae be wòanye Ghana ƒe Dɔdzikpɔlagã le United Kingdom le Ɣeyiɣi aɖe ƒe Dukɔa ƒe Takpɔkpɔ ƒe Aɖaŋuɖoha ƒe ɣeyiɣi me le ƒe 1982 me eye wòyi edzi nɔ ɖoƒe sia vaseɖe ƒe 1985 ƒe nuwuwu. Esi wòxɔ dzudzɔ le dɔme le UNCTAD le ƒe 1994 me la, Rawlings dziɖuɖua tiae abe Ghana ƒe Dɔdzikpɔlagã ene le UK ake.",
        "To eƒe fotoɖeɖe kple nɔnɔmetatawo wɔwɔ ƒe dɔwo me la, Mounia Youssef wɔa aʋa be ŋutsuwo kple nyɔnuwo nasɔ eye wòdoa ameyibɔwo ƒe dzedzeme ɖe ŋgɔ to atsyɔ̃ɖoɖo ƒe dzidzenu yeyewo gbugbɔŋlɔ me, vevietɔ Afro-dzidzimeviwo ƒe dzɔdzɔme ɖa si le ʋuʋu ɖi.",
        "Enye klosalo medaasixɔla le ame etɔ̃ ƒe basketball me le ƒe 2019 Afrika Ƒuta Kamedefefewo me, esi wòxɔ akɔbli le ƒe 2018 Afrika Kplu me. .",
        "Gntegma ƒo bɔl na Tempête FC kple Athlèta FC le Togo kple Raja Ain Harrouda le Morocco.",
        "Wodzi Petitjean le Togo, na Togo vidada si na mɔnukpɔkpɔe be wòaʋli ho ɖe dukɔa ta. Togo Ski Federation do ka kplii le Tedoxe 2013 me to Facebook dzi be wòaʋli ho na dukɔa le Dzomeŋɔli Olympics me. Petitjean nɔ eƒe agbe ƒe akpa gãtɔ le Haute-Savoie, France, afisi wòsrɔ̃ tsikpedzizɔzɔ le.",
        "Wodzi Asih le Kpalimé, Togo le ƒe 1979 me. Eƒe didi vevie ɖe sinima ŋu tso eƒe ɖevime ke. Le ƒe 2001 me la, exɔ hehe abe mɔ̃ɖaŋudɔwɔla ene le kɔmpiuta dzi nɔnɔmetatawo kple fotoɖeɖe me. Le ƒe 2006 me la, Assih srɔ̃ nu tso screenwriting kple documentary wɔwɔ ŋu le Africadoc, le Senegal. Le ɣeyiɣi sia ke me la, exɔ BTS le kadodo me tso Afrika ƒe Asitsanyawo Ŋuti Nusrɔ̃ƒe. Le ƒe 2009 me la, Asih xɔ ɖaseɖigbalẽ le Amewo ƒe Dɔwɔnuwo Dzikpɔkpɔ me.",
        "Wodzii le Tsévié, Togo, na Togotɔ fofo si tso Nigeria eye dadaa nye Ghanatɔ. Bellow ƒe dukɔwo dome fefe gbãtɔe nye le ƒe 1966 me, esime wònɔ Togo teƒe le Xexeame ƒe Ameyibɔwo ƒe Aɖaŋudɔwo ƒe Ŋkekenyui Gbãtɔ me le Dakar, Senegal. Eƒe haƒogbalẽ gbãtɔ si ŋkɔe nye Rockya do le ƒe 1969 me. Le albɔm la me la, Camerountɔwo ƒe haƒoha si me Manu Dibango le kpe ɖe eŋu, le saxophone, keyboards kple arrangement dzi, Jeannot Madingué le bass dzi, Slim Pezin le gita dzi eye Ben tɔ le drums dzi",
        "Le ƒe 2018 me la, Aquereburu nye Les Maternelles d’Afrique, si nye Afrikatɔwo ƒe Franseawo ƒe wɔna si nye La Maison des Maternelles ƒe wɔnawo dzikpɔla. Afrika vidadawo kpakple eya ŋutɔ ƒe ƒomea ƒe dzimaɖitsitsiwoe ʋãe. Nukpɔkpɔa ƒo nu tso srɔ̃ geɖe ɖeɖe ƒe nya si ŋu nyaʋiʋliwo le ŋu le mɔ si me ameŋkumemakpɔmakpɔ le nu.",
        "Le ƒe 2015 me la, Tignokpa nye Afrika Sewɔtakpekpe me tɔwo ƒe Habɔbɔ si Kpɔa Ŋgɔyidɔwo Gbɔ (APNODE) ƒe gɔmeɖola.",
        "Le Dame 2022 me la, woɖo Seleshi Bekele be wòanye Ethiopia ƒe dudɔnunɔla le United States, eye ɖoƒe sia nɔ esi vaseɖe Dame 2024 me, esime wòdzo yi ɖawɔ ame ŋutɔ ƒe dɔwɔwɔ ƒe",
        "Daphrose Mukankubito Gahakwa tsi le Uganda. Ewu Makerere Yunivɛsiti nu le ƒe 1996 me kple Dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunya ƒe Dzeside. Emegbe eyi edzi xɔ Dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunya ƒe ɖaseɖigbalẽ le numiemiewo nyinyi me le ƒe 1997 me eye wòxɔ PhD le ƒe 2001 me, eye wo ame evea siaa tso East Anglia Yunivɛsiti le England.",
        "Manuel A. Alculete Lopes de Araújo nye Mozambique dunyahela. Enye Quelimane, si nye du aɖe le Mozambique, ƒe Dumegã tso Dzome 2011 me.",
        "Isabelle Housna Kassire nye dunyahela si tso Chad. Fifia enye Dutanyawo Gbɔkpɔla le Chad dziɖuɖua me.",
        "Kojo Botsio de Adisadel Kɔledzi kple Achimota Kɔledzi le Ghana. Emegbe eyi Sierra Leone eye wòxɔ eƒe ɖaseɖigbalẽ gbãtɔ le Fourah Bay Yunivɛsiti Kɔledzi. Le ƒe 1945 me la, eyi United Kingdom eye wòsrɔ̃ nu le Brasenose College, Oxford Yunivɛsiti, afisi wòxɔ Anyigbaŋutinunya kple Sukudede ƒe ɖaseɖigbalẽ le.",
        "Wodzi Alex Ayité Gachin Mivedor le 2 Tedoxe 1927, eku le 18 Dzove 2012. Enye Togotɔ mɔ̃ɖaŋudɔwɔla kple dunyahela. Enɔ subɔsubɔhakplɔlawo ƒe dziɖuɖu ƒe ɖoƒewo, eye wobunɛ zi geɖe be enye dumevi dzro evelia le Gnassingbé Eyadema ƒe dziɖuɖu me. Wodzi Mivedor le Aného, ​​Franseawo ƒe Dahomey le 2 Tedoxe 1997 . Mina ƒome aɖe mee wònye . Esrɔ̃ nu le Bamako le ƒe 1943 kple 1947 dome, eye emegbe le Toulouse kple Paris le ƒe 1947 kple 1955 dome, eye wòwu suku nu abe tsi kple elektrikmɔ̃ɖaŋudɔwɔla ene . Le eƒe sukunuwuwu megbe la etrɔ yi Bamako afisi wòwɔ dɔ le na dukɔa ƒe tsidɔwɔƒe . Le ƒe 1956 va ɖo 1958 ƒe Bamako nɔnɔ me la, eva ge ɖe sɔhɛwo ƒe habɔbɔ si me tɔwo nye zazɛ̃nyahelawo ƒe habɔbɔ me, eye wotiam Sɔhɛwo ƒe Aɖaŋudeha ƒe agbalẽŋlɔlagã le Soudan le eƒe takpekpe gbãtɔ me le Masa 9 vaseɖe 11, 1957 . Le ƒe 1958 me la, etrɔ yi Togo afisi woɖoe be wòanye Dudɔnunɔlawo ƒe Dɔwɔƒe ƒe Elektrik kple Tsi Dɔwɔƒe ƒe tatɔ (dɔ si wòanɔ vaseɖe ƒe 1966 me) .",
        "Le dziɖuɖu si ŋkɔ woyɔ le Masa 20, 2005 dzi, si mɛ tsitretsiɖeŋulawo hã nɔ me la, woɖo Ayéva Dukɔa ƒe Dutanyawo kple Afrika ƒe Ðekawɔwɔ ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla.",
        "Anloga nye kɔƒe aɖe le Keta Nutome le Volta nuto me le anyieheɣedzeƒe Gana. Ele Volta Tɔsisia ƒe ɣedzeƒe kple Keta amu ƒe anyiehe. Anloga nye Gana ƒe du si nye ame gbogbo siwo le edzi yim la ƒe teƒe blaene vɔ adrelia, eye ame 35,933 ye le edzi yim.",
        "Dzɔgbenyuie (Dɔmenyonyo), na Tenor kple pianoforte (ƒe 1977)",
        "Ouro-Akpo ƒo klab bɔl le Togo kple Germany na Maranatha, Rot-Weiß Oberhausen, Germania Gladbeck, Schwarz-Weiß Essen, S. C. Westfalia Herne, S. C. Fortuna Köln, S. V. Schermbeck, TSV Marl-Hüls, D. S. C. Wanne-Eickel kple B. W. Oberhausen -Lirich.[1][2] ƒe nyatakakadzraɖoƒea.",
        "Enye Dɔwɔnuwo, Tomenukuƒewo, Posudɔwɔƒewo kple Telefonkadodowo ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla le ƒe 1980 ƒeawo ƒe gɔmedzedze.",
        "To eƒe sidzedze zazã abe sukudede ƒe susuŋutinunyala ene me la, edze sinimawo dzi kpɔkpɔ gɔme.",
        "Bradley Laurent Barcola (wodzi le 2 September 2002) nye Franseawo ƒe bɔlƒola bibi si ƒoa bɔl abe ŋgɔgbe alo aʋala ene na Ligue 1 habɔbɔ si nye Paris Saint-Germain kple France dukɔa ƒe bɔlƒoha.",
        "Egawɔ eve bubu abe ame si xɔ ɖe eteƒe ene le hoʋiʋlia me: miniti 15 kple Portugal le quarter finals me, eye miniti 30 kple Spain le semi-finals me, si wu enu kple dziɖuɖu 2–1.",
        "Wodzi Folly Ayayi le Togo, eye wòʋu yi Ivory Coast le eƒe ɖevime eye wònye dukɔmevi eve.",
        "Afrikatɔwo ƒe ɣeɖuɖu, si wogayɔna be Afro ɣeɖuɖu, lɔ ɣeɖuɖu ƒe atsyã vovovo siwo dzɔ tso Afrika ƒe anyiehe Sahara ɖe eme. Ɣeɖuɖu siawo ƒo ke ɖe to ɖe nutoa me ƒe hadzidzi kple haƒoƒo ƒe kɔnyinyiwo me vevie, eye wowɔa akpa vevi aɖe le dekɔnuwo ɖeɖefia me. Le Afrika-dukɔ geɖe me la, hadzidzi kple ɣeɖuɖu le vevie ŋutɔ hena hadomedzidzenuwo fiafia, ŋkuɖoɖo agbemenudzɔdzɔ ɖedzesiwo dzi, ŋutinya si wogblɔ kple nu la takpɔkpɔ, kple gbɔgbɔmenuteƒekpɔkpɔwo dodo ɖe ŋgɔ. Esi ɣeɖuɖu vovovowo kple ŋutilã bliboa ƒe ʋuʋu ɖe dzesi ta la, zi geɖe la, wowɔa Afrikatɔwo ƒe ɣeɖuɖuwo ɖekae le ƒuƒoƒo gãwo me, si wɔnɛ be ɣeɖulawo kple nukpɔlawo nɔa kadodo sesẽwo me.",
        "Zi geɖe la, woɖua ɣea le kuteƒewo, srɔ̃ɖeƒewo, kple azãɖuƒewo. Le nyateƒe me la, enyea Eʋetɔwo ƒe dekɔnu ƒe dzesi eye to bubuwo me tɔwo da asi ɖe edzi be edze ƒã be Eʋetɔwo. To vovo na Eʋetɔwo ƒe ɣeɖuɖu bubu aɖewo, siwo ŋu woate ŋu axe mɔ ɖo le ƒe si woxɔ, mawusubɔsubɔ, alo ŋutsu alo nyɔnu nyenye nu la, amesiame ate ŋu aɖu ɣe sia. Woyɔa esia ɣeaɖewoɣi be “koklozi ƒe ɣeɖuɖu” le eƒe ʋuʋu abe xevi ene ta.",
        "Wodzi Gates le Seattle, Washington, eye wonyii le afima. Le ƒe 1975 me la, eya kple Allen woɖo Microsoft le Albuquerque, New Mexico. Gates xɔ ŋgɔ na dɔwɔƒea abe eƒe zimenɔla kple dɔdzikpɔlagã ene vaseɖe esime wòɖe asi le dɔdzikpɔlagã ƒe ɖoƒe ŋu le January 2000 me, eye Steve Ballmer va xɔ ɖe eteƒe, gake egakpɔtɔ nye dɔdzikpɔha ƒe zimenɔla eye wòva zu kɔmpiutadziɖoɖowo ƒe xɔtuɖaŋunyalagã.",
        "Bawumia ɖe Samira Bawumia eye vi ene le wo si. Enye Mabia (Mossi-Dagbon) to me tɔ . Moslemtɔe wònye. Wotsɔ Yaa Naa Mahamadu Bila, si nye Dagbon - fia si ɖu dzi tso ƒe 1948 va ɖo ƒe 1953 ƒe ŋkɔ na Bawumia. Ŋkɔ Bawumia gɔmee nye \"Wose\" le Dagbanli kple Gmampruli gbewo me.",
        "Le Rastatɔwo ƒe dzixɔse si keke ta wu nu la, Mawu ƒe fiaɖuƒe si wogblɔ ɖi le etsɔme la aɖu dzi tegbee tso eƒe fiadu si le Ethiopia le woƒe Mesia la te; Ɣemaɣi la, xexeame ƒe gbe si wozãna ɖaa anye Amharicgbe . Ame akpa gãtɔ mexɔ Fiagã Haile Selassie be eku o; Wogblɔna be Mawu mekuna o, eye fifia Mesia la le Babilon ƒe anyidzedze ƒe ɣeyiɣi lalam le adzame . Wogblɔna be esi ɖiɖi sia manɔ anyi ƒe geɖe o ta la, menye ɣeyiɣia de be woaɖo ɖoɖo kple dziɖuɖu sesẽ abe Kristotɔnyenye alo subɔsubɔha bubuwo katã ene o. Abe alesi Janhoi ɖe emee ene la, wodea bubu dzitsinya ƒe ablɔɖe ŋu vevie. Hafi ɣemaɣi naɖo la, woyɔa Babilontɔwo ƒe xaxaɣi si li fifia be \"Amagideon\" (woɖe nya la tso Harmagedon me). Wofiaa nu be afɔɖeɖe gbãtɔ si ana ame nazu Rasta nɔviŋutsu alo nɔvinyɔnue nye be nàdzo le Babilon.",
        "Njami Simon, Lucy Durán. Africa Remix: Contemporary Art of a Continent, Johannesburg, Jacana Media, 2007. ISBN 978-1-77009-363-8",
        "\"The Beautyful Ones\" Series #5 (2016), Buffalo AKG Art Museum, Buffalo, New York [51]",
        "In May 2018, Akunyili Crosby set a new personal auction record with the sale of her painting Bush Babies for nearly $3.4 million at Sotheby's New York.",
        "/garden-thriving\". MOCA.Museum_of_Contemporary_Art,_Los_Angeles archive. from the original on 18 December 2022. Retrieved 18 December 2022.",
        "Zigeɖe la, wolɔ̃a Aso Olona la kple dzesi siwo tsɔa gɔmesesewo ɖe asi. Wozãnɛ le Yoruba ƒe ɖekɔnu nudodowo si nye Kaja alo Pakaja, si nye Yoruba ƒe awu si wotsɔa aŋɔ wɔe. Azɔ hã, wozãa Aso Olona na Iro ati Buba, si nye \"blouse\" awu legbe ƒoƒu kple awu legbe gã si wodona. Wotsɔa nuzazãwo abe Gele (taku), Ipele \"shawl\", eye woɖo atsyɔ̃ kple dzonu si le dekɔnu ɖe asi vevienyenye tɔ.",
        "Le eƒe dɔwɔnawo katã me la, Kiwanga wɔ numekuku le ŋutinya kple dzɔdzɔmeŋutinunya ƒe nudzraɖoƒewo ŋu tsɔ wɔ eƒe nutatawo. Le eƒe dɔwɔwɔ gbãtɔ ƒe agbalẽ etɔ̃ siwo nye Afrogalactica (2011–) me la, Kiwanga wɔa amegbetɔŋutinunyala aɖe si tso etsɔme si ƒoa nuƒo tso nyakpakpa kple nyateƒenyawo ŋu siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye numekuku le Afrofuturism, Afrikatɔwo ƒe ɣletiviŋutinunya kple ŋutsu alo nyɔnu nyenye kple ameƒomevinyenye ƒe hatsotsowo tutu ŋu ƒe akpa dzi. Kiwanga wɔa dɔ kple agbalẽnyalawo kple agbalẽdzraɖoƒewo le wɔna bubuwo me: A Conservator's Tale (2014) kple A spell to bound the Limitless (2014).",
        "Ankara: Enye kotoklobɔ ƒe avɔ aɖe si dzɔ tso Netherlandtɔwo kple Indonesiatɔwo gbɔ gake exɔ ŋkɔ le Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika le eƒe amadede vovovowo kple dzesi siwo le eme la ta. Wogayɔa Ankara be Netherlandstɔwo ƒe waksi, Afrikatɔwo ƒe waksi, alo Afrikatɔwo ƒe agbalẽtata. Yoruba ye wowɔ Ankara avɔ. Ankara ate ŋu ata tanya kple dzesi vovovowo ɖe edzi, abe seƒoƒowo, lãwo, ɣletiviwo, alo nɔnɔme siwo me susu mele o ene.",
        "Le ƒe 1870 me la, anyigbagã la ƒe 10% nɔ European ƒe ŋusẽ te le se nu. Kaka ƒe 1914 naɖo la, xexlẽme sia dzi ɖe edzi va ɖo 90% kloe; dukɔ siwo gakpɔtɔ nɔ woƒe ɖokuisi nye Liberia, Ethiopia, Egba, Aussa, Senusiyya, Mbunda, Dervish Dukɔa, Darfur Sultanate, kple Ovambo fiaɖuƒewo. Europatɔwo va ɖu wodometɔ akpa gãtɔ dzi emegbe.",
        "Le ƒe 2004 me la, senyala aɖe si ŋkɔe nye Ed Fagan, si kpɔ gome le nya aɖewo siwo ŋu nyaʋiʋliwo nɔ me la tsɔ nya ɖe Lloyd’s of London, si nye nugblẽfexeha gã aɖe ŋu le se nu. Nyadɔdrɔ̃a gblɔ be Lloyd’s si tso London gbɔe wòtso elabena wowɔa nugblẽfexeɖoɖo na meli siwo wozãna le Atlantik-ƒua dzi kluvisitsatsa me. Ke hã, nyaa medze edzi o.",
        "Kpekpeɖeŋunana le se nu tso dukɔ siwo katã kpɔ gome le kluvinyenye me gbɔ, tsɔ wu be woagblɔ “vevese” ko.",
        "Ameyibɔwo ƒe Agbenɔnɔ Le Vevie (Black Lives Matter) nye habɔbɔ si keke ta si di be yeaɖe alesi Ameyibɔwo kpɔa ameƒomevinyenye kple nuwɔwɔ madzɔmadzɔe la afia. Eƒonɛ ɖe ameƒomevinyenye ƒe vovototodedeameme hã nu, si fia be woawɔ avu kple ameƒomevinyenye veviedodotɔe.",
        "Black Lives Matter Global Network Foundation, si nye habɔbɔ vevi aɖe si wɔa ɖoɖo ɖe agbagbadzedzewo ŋu le dukɔa me godoo, ɖe gbeƒãe be yewofɔ dɔlar miliɔn 90 le ƒe 2020 me (anɔ abe dɔlar miliɔn 109 ene le ƒe 2024 me). Esia ƒe akpa gã aɖe tso ame ɖekaɖekawo ƒe nudzɔdzɔwo le Internet dzi me, eye nudzɔdzɔ si wodzɔna le mama dedie nu nye dɔlar 30.76 (anɔ abe dɔlar 37.37 ene egbea).",
        "Ɣeaɖewoɣi la, Black Lives Matter ƒe tsitretsiɖeŋulawo dzea ŋgɔ nya si tututu ŋu wole nu ƒom tsoe: kpovitɔwo ƒe dɔwɔwɔ fũ akpa. Le kpɔɖeŋu me, le May 2020 me la, menye ɖeko kpovitɔwo wɔ nu ɖe ​​tsitretsiɖeŋulawo ŋu ko o, ke wodɔ asrafoha 43,350 hã ɖa be woakpɔ Black Lives Matter ƒe tsitretsiɖeŋulawo gbɔ le dukɔa me godoo. Wozã asrafowo ƒe yameʋu siwo léa ŋku ɖe nu ŋu gɔ̃ hã le tsitretsiɖeŋu siwo wowɔ emegbe me.",
        "Le June me la, BLM kple Color of Change me tɔwo tsi tre ɖe wo nɔewo ŋu le California. Wonɔ nu ƒom tsi tre ɖe Jasmine Richards ƒe fɔbubu kple tohehea ŋu. Le ƒe 2015 me la, Richards dze agbagba be yeaxe mɔ na kpovitɔ aɖe be wòagalé nyɔnu bubu o. Wobu fɔe be \"edze agbagba be yeaxɔ ame aɖe le ŋutifafadɔwɔla aɖe ƒe dzikpɔkpɔ te le se nu madzemadzee.\" Woyɔ nutsotso sia be \"lynching\" le dukɔa ƒe sewo me vaseɖe ɣleti eve do ŋgɔ na nudzɔdzɔa, esime woɖe nya la ɖa.",
        "Le January 2023 me la, woɖe video siwo ɖe Tire Nichols ƒe ku fia, si na wowɔ tsitretsiɖeŋu le Memphis. Al Sharpton si le National Action Network ƒo nu tso nya sia ŋu le dutoƒo esi ame kukua ƒe fotoɖemɔ̃a ƒe fotowo va li vɔ megbe.",
        "Menye ɖeko tsitretsiɖeŋu siawo siwo wowɔ le UK la nye be woaɖee afia be yewole megbe na United States ƒe ʋunyaʋunyawɔlawo o. Wode bubu Ameyibɔ siwo ku le UK hã ŋu. Tsitretsiɖeŋulawo nɔ ha dzim, tsɔ dzesiwo ɖe asi, eye wogblɔ amesiwo ŋu wowɔ nuvevii abe Julian Cole, Belly Mujinga, Nuno Cardoso, kple Sarah Reed ƒe ŋkɔwo le hadomenyatakakadzraɖoƒewo.",
        "Alesi amewo bua Ameyibɔwo ƒe Agbenɔnɔ Le Vevie (BLM) habɔbɔa le United States la toa vovo ŋutɔ ɣesiaɣi le woƒe ameƒomevinyenye kple dunyahehe me dzixɔsewo nu. Do ŋgɔ na ƒe 2018 la, Amerikatɔ akpa gãtɔ meda asi ɖe habɔbɔa dzi o, gake emegbe edze kpekpeɖeŋu geɖe xɔxɔ gɔme.",
        "Le January 2021 me la, Petter Eide, si nye dunyahela aɖe si tso Norway, tsɔ Ameyibɔwo ƒe Agbenɔnɔ Le Vevie (BLM) habɔbɔa ɖo ŋgɔ be woaxɔ Nobel Ŋutifafa Nunana. Gake fetua va yi na nyadzɔdzɔŋlɔla Maria Ressa kple Dmitry Muratov mlɔeba.",
        "Kluvinyenye bɔ ɖe Afrika le ŋutinya me. Kluvinyenye kple kluvinyenye ƒe ɖoɖowo bɔ ɖe Afrika ƒe akpa aɖewo tsã, abe alesi wònɔ le blema kple titinaɣeyiɣiwo me xexeame ƒe akpa mamlɛa ƒe akpa gãtɔ ene .Esi kluvisitsatsa le Sahara-dukɔwo dzi, kluvisitsatsa le Ƒudzĩa dzi, kluvisitsatsa le India-ƒua dzi kple kluvisitsatsa le Atlantik-ƒua dzi (si dze egɔme le ƒe alafa 16 lia me) dze egɔme la, Afrika-kluviwo ƒe ɖoɖo siwo nɔ nutoa me do ŋgɔ dometɔ geɖe te aboyomewo nana kluviwo ƒe asiwo le Afrika godo. .Kluvinyenye le egbegbe Afrika gakpɔtɔ li le nuto aɖewo me togbɔ be womele se nu o hã.",
        "Woawɔ ɖoɖo ɖe ɖoɖowo ŋu eye woawɔ ɖeka le nutome ganyawo ƒe habɔbɔ siwo li fifia kple esiwo ava va dome be woate ŋu aɖo Habɔbɔa ƒe taɖodzinuwo gbɔ vivivi.",
        "Afrika Dukɔwo ƒe Habɔbɔ ɖoe be yeaɖo gadzikpɔha vevi etɔ̃: Afrika ƒe Gadzraɖoƒegã si le Abuja, Nigeria; Afrikatɔwo ƒe Gadodo ƒe Gadzraɖoƒe aɖe si le Tripoli, Libya; kple Afrikatɔwo ƒe Ganyawo Gbɔkpɔha aɖe si le Yaoundé, Cameroon. Womeɖo dɔwɔƒe siawo bliboe haɖe o, gake kɔmitiwo le dɔ wɔm be yewoaɖo wo. Taɖodzinu vevitɔ na AU enye be ga ɖeka, si woyɔna be \"Afro,\" nanɔ anyigbagã bliboa dzi.",
        "Esi Aƒetɔ Robert Smirke ƒe xɔ yeye gã la va nɔ nɔnɔme xɔm vivivi la, blemanudzraɖoƒea va zu xɔtuƒe gã aɖe. Wowu Fia ƒe Agbalẽdzraɖoƒe si le East Wing ƒe anyigbaxɔdzo dzi la nu le ƒe 1827 me eye wobui be enye xɔ dzeanitɔwo kekeake dometɔ ɖeka le London. Togbɔ be womeʋui na amewo bliboe o vaseɖe ƒe 1857 me hã la, wowɔ ɖoɖo ɖe ekpɔkpɔ tɔxɛwo ŋu le Ƒe 1851 ƒe Nukpɔkpɔ Gã la me.",
        "Amerikatɔ xɔtuɖaŋunyala John Russell Pope ye wɔ Duveen Nukpɔƒe si le Egiptetɔwo, Helatɔwo, kple Asiriatɔwo ƒe kpememewo ƒe xɔwo ƒe ɣetoɖoƒe gome la be woatsɔ aɖe Elgin Marble-kpewo afia. Togbɔ be wowu enu le ƒe 1938 me hã la, bɔmb aɖe da ɖe edzi le ƒe 1940 me, si na eƒe akpa aɖe zu glikpo ƒe 22 hafi wogaʋui mlɔeba le ƒe 1962. Nuto bubu siwo dome gblẽ le Xexemeʋa II ƒe bɔmbdada me dometɔ aɖewoe nye Edward VII ƒe nukpɔƒe siwo bɔmb eve siwo mewó o da le September 1940. Fia ƒe Agbalẽdzraɖoƒea tsɔ bɔmb sesẽ aɖe, . eye bɔmb siwo le dzo dam la ge ɖe Nuxexlẽxɔ Goglo la ƒe dome gake womegblẽ nu boo aɖeke o. Le May 10-11, 1941 ƒe zã me la, bɔmb geɖe siwo le dzo dam la dze blemanudzraɖoƒea ƒe dzigbeɣetoɖoƒe gome, eye wogblẽ agbalẽdzraɖoƒea kple agbalẽ 150,000 siwo le xɔxɔnua, kpakple nutataɖeƒe siwo ƒo xlã Atrakpui Gã la tame hã. Womedzra nusiwo gblẽ sia ɖo bliboe o vaseɖe ƒe 1960 ƒeawo ƒe gɔmedzedze.",
        "Kpememe siwo woɖe tso Djehutyhotep ƒe yɔdo me le Deir-el-Bersha (ƒe 1878–1855 D.M.Ŋ.)",
        "Hathor ƒe sɔti gã aɖe tame (fiadu) tso Bubastis (ƒe 922–887 D.M.Ŋ.)",
        "Akɔblikaɖi kple patera tso X-ƒuƒoƒo ƒe yɔdowo me, Qasr Ibrim (ƒe alafa 1 lia–6 lia M.Ŋ.)",
        "Akpa sia yɔ blemanu vovovo siwo ŋu woke ɖo tso Hela kple Italy tso gɔmedzedzea me ke vaseɖe ƒe alafa 8 lia D.M.Ŋ. Nu siawo na míekpɔa alesi amewo nɔ agbe ɣemaɣi.",
        "Akɔbli ƒe nɔnɔmetata aɖe si tso Latian nutoa me si wokpɔ le Diana ƒe Kɔkɔeƒe, Nemi Ta, Latium (ƒe 200–100 D.M.Ŋ.).",
        "Guildford Puteal, si nye vudo aɖe si wokpa tso Korinto, Hela (30–10 D.M.Ŋ.).",
        "Hafi Ghana Fiaɖuƒea namu le ƒe alafa 10 lia ƒe gɔmedzedze la, Akantɔwo ʋu yi dzigbe. Wowɔ dukɔ sue geɖe, siwo woɖo ɖe woƒe ƒomewo ƒe ƒuƒoƒowo ŋu. Bono-dukɔae nye esiawo dometɔ gbãtɔ, si woɖo le ƒe alafa 11 lia me. Wotsɔ ŋkɔ na Brong-Ahafo (si nye Bono Ahafo fifia) nutoa. Mole-Dagbontɔwo hã tso Chad-ta me va Ghana egbea eye woɖo fiaɖuƒe gbãtɔ siwo woɖo ɖe ɖoɖo nu la dometɔ aɖewo ɖe afima. Emegbe la, ɖewohĩ Akantɔwo ƒe ƒuƒoƒo bubuwo abe Ashantitɔwo, Akwamutɔwo, Akyemtɔwo, kple Fantetɔwo ene dzɔ tso Bonotɔwo ƒe nɔƒe gbãtɔ le Bono Manso. Ashanti-fiaɖuƒea dze egɔme abe dukɔwo ƒe ƒuƒoƒo si mebɔbɔ o ene gake etsi va zu fiaɖuƒe sesẽ aɖe si le titina, si me dziɖuɖu si ŋu ɖoɖo le nyuie, si le eƒe fiadu Kumasi me.",
        "Le ƒe 1830 me la, asitsalawo ƒe kɔmiti aɖe si le London tia Kapitan George Maclean be wòaxɔ ŋgɔ na asitsalawo ƒe aɖaŋuɖoha aɖe si le nutoa me. Togbɔ be ŋusẽ si le esi le dziɖuɖumegãwo me mede naneke o hã la, Maclean te ŋu wɔ nu geɖe. Le kpɔɖeŋu me, ewɔ ɖoɖo ɖe ŋutifafanubabla aɖe ŋu kple Ashantitɔwo le ƒe 1831. Maclean kpɔ ƒutatɔwo hã dzi to ʋɔnudrɔ̃ƒe wɔwɔ edziedzi le Cape Coast, afisi wòhea to na amesiwo wobu fɔe be wogblẽ ŋutifafa me. Le ƒe 1830 kple 1843 dome, esime Maclean nɔ nyawo dzi kpɔm le Gold Coast la, masɔmasɔ aɖeke menɔ wo kple Ashantitɔwo dome o, eye wogblɔ be asitsatsa ƒe agbɔsɔsɔ dzi ɖe edzi zi gbɔ zi etɔ̃.",
        "Nu siawo na Ðɔkta J. B. Danquah ɖo United Gold Coast Convention (UGCC) le ƒe 1947 me, eye wokpe Nkrumah be wòanye akpahaa ƒe agbalẽŋlɔlagã. Woƒe taɖodzinue nye ɖokuisinɔnɔ na Ghana. Wogbe Burns ƒe dukplɔsea eye wodo susu ɖa be woawɔ ɖɔɖɔɖo le eƒe nya geɖe ŋu. Ena gbe amegãwo kple woƒe towo ƒe aɖaŋuɖohawo hã to mɔɖeɖe ɖe nutome takpekpewo ɖoɖo ŋu me. Se aɖeke si atrɔ dukplɔsea ƒe nya siwo wokpɔ ta na alo akpɔ ŋusẽ ɖe nutome habɔbɔwo ƒe ŋusẽ alo amegãwo ƒe mɔnukpɔkpɔwo dzi la mate ŋu ava zu se o negbe ɖe Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpea ƒe akɔdada eve le etɔ̃ me da asi ɖe edzi eye woda asi ɖe edzi to ame akpa gãtɔ ƒe akɔdada bɔbɔe me le nutome sewɔtakpekpewo ƒe akpa eve le etɔ̃ me ko hafi. Gake esi nutoa me CPP ƒe akpadzinɔlawo va kpɔ ŋusẽ ɖe nutome sewɔtakpekpe siwo sɔ dzi la, Nkrumah dziɖuɖua de se aɖe kaba si ɖe ametakpɔkpɔ ƒe nya tɔxɛ sia ɖa le dukplɔsea me. Afɔɖeɖe sia na ŋusẽ Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpea be wòawɔ tɔtrɔ ɖesiaɖe si CPP susu be ehiã le dukplɔse me.",
        "Ghana nye dukɔ gbãtɔ le Sub Sahara Afrika aɖe ahedada dzi akpɔtɔ afã, eye wòto esia me do go Ƒe Akpe Ðeka la Ŋgɔyiyi ƒe Taɖodzinu gbãtɔ. Ke hã, ahedada goglo gakpɔtɔ le kɔƒenuto akpa gãtɔwo me, vevietɔ le dziehe nuto etɔ̃awo me. Le dugãwo me, afisi ahedada dzɔna le kpɔ ɖiɖi gã aɖe gɔhã woade dzesi vovototo gãwo kple tasɔsɔmasɔwo.",
        "Richard Leakey, 1999 ƒe ɣleti.19 décembre 1944, blema amegbetɔŋutinunyala .",
        "Kofi Awoonor, si wowu le21 septembre 2013 .",
        "Wodzi Fred Amugi le Teshie, Accra, Ghana le 5 Adamekpɔxɛ 1948. Ede Broaks Gɔmedzesuku kple Titinasuku, eye emegbe wòde Takoradi kple Nungua Sekɛndrisuku. Ege ɖe dudɔnunɔlawo ƒe dɔ me ƒe blaetɔ̃ vɔ etɔ̃ eye wònye Dɔdzikpɔla si kpɔa Dɔwɔnyawo gbɔ le Ghana ƒe Ganyawo Gbɔkpɔƒe",
        "Ƒe 2017 me : Dɔdzikpɔla nyuitɔ kekeake le 14 me si Hadzidziwo Katã ƒe Kafukafuhawo",
        "Kpɔe do ŋgɔ : August 19, 2023 le Lomé, Concorde Xɔ (Amedzrodzeƒe 2 Février)",
        "Beverly xɔ hehe abe atsyɔ̃ɖoɖo ŋuti nunyala ene le FC Institute of Beauty Therapy, Ghana, eye wònye Ghana Institute of Journalism, afisi wòsrɔ̃ nyadzɔdzɔŋlɔlawo kple dutoƒo kadodowo le la ƒe sukuvi tsã. Le fefewɔwɔ manɔmila, ewɔa dɔ le Glamour Beauty Salon le Tema . Edze eƒe asitsaha yeye si woyɔna be Traffic Shawarma gɔme nyitsɔ le 5 April 2024. Egblɔ alesi mekpɔa dzidzɔ ɖe sinimawɔlawo kple sinimadzikpɔlawo ƒe fefewɔla xoxowo mazamazã le woƒe sinimadɔwo me ŋu o. Ete gbe ɖe alesi nyametsotso siwo wowɔna le ame siwo woatsɔ awɔ dɔe ŋu trɔ tso ŋutigbalẽ ƒe amadede ƒe akpaɖekedzi mademade dzi va zu amesiwo si ame ŋutɔ ƒe kadodo sẽŋuwo le ƒe nyonyo dzi. Ede dzesii be fefewɔla alo fefewɔla nyenye meganye ŋutete o, ke boŋ ele be kadodo siwo le ame si be wòanɔ sinimawo me nanɔ ame si. Le eƒe nya nu la, nɔnɔme sia aɖe sinimawɔwɔ ƒe nyonyome dzi kpɔtɔna.",
        "Fufu (alo fufuo, foofoo, foufou) nye nuɖuɖu si woɖuna le Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika ƒe dometɔ ɖeka. Enye Twigbe me nya si tso Akantɔwo gbɔ le Ghana. Woate ŋu akpɔ nuɖuɖu sia ƒe vovototowo le Afrika dukɔ bubuwo me, siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye Sierra Leone, Liberia, Cote D'Ivoire, Burkina Faso, Benin, Togo, Nigeria, Cameroon, Democratic Republic of Congo, Central African Republic, Republic of Congo, Angola kple Gabon. Wode dzesi Fufu ƒe bɔbɔ le Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika nuto suewo me le agbalẽ siwo agbalẽŋlɔla siwo tso ma me ŋlɔ me. Woƒo nu tso eŋu le Chinua Achebe ƒe agbalẽ si nye Things Fall Apart me, le kpɔɖeŋu me,",
        "Chimamanda Ngozi Adichie (Se; wodzii le 15 September 1977) nye Nigeriatɔ agbalẽŋlɔla, amesi ƒe agbalẽwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye nyakpakpawo, nyakpakpa siwo menye nyakpakpawo o, kple nuƒoƒo. Wonyae le afisiafi be enye ame vevi aɖe le nyɔnuwo ƒe agbalẽ siwo woŋlɔ le dutanyigbadziɖuɖu megbe me.",
        "Josefina Perpétua Pitra Diakité nye Angola ƒe dudɔnunɔla le South Africa tso ƒe 2011 vaseɖe ƒe 2017. Enye Angola ƒe amedɔdɔ le United States tso ƒe 2001 va ɖo September 1, 2011.",
        "Gomashie ɖe Martin K.G. si megali o. Ahiaglo ƒe ŋkɔ. Wo ame evea medzi vi aɖeke ɖekae o. Gake viŋutsuvi aɖe le Dzifa si tso ƒomedodo aɖe si nɔ wo dome do ŋgɔ me. Kristotɔe wònye.",
        "Jean Kapata (wodzi le December 25, 1960) nye Zambia dunyahela eye wònye Anyigbawo kple Dzɔdzɔmenuwo ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla tsã.",
        "Nenadi Esther Usman (wodzi le 12 November 1966) nye Nigeria dunyahela si nye Dukɔa ƒe Zimenɔla na Dɔwɔlawo ƒe Habɔbɔ tso ƒe 2026. Enye Ganyawo ƒe Dɔdzikpɔla tsã, wotiam be manye sewɔtakpekpe me tɔ le Nigeria Dukɔa ƒe Sewɔtakpekpe me si nɔ Kaduna South Senatorial District teƒe le April 2011 ƒe tiatiawɔɣi, eye wònɔ du ƒum le People’s Democratic Party (PDP) ƒe nuƒolanɔƒe.",
        "Srɔ̃tɔe wònye eye wònye vidada si si vi eve le. Exɔ Senyawo ƒe Dzeside, si Makerere University na, le Kampala, Uganda ƒe fiadu me. Exɔ Senyawo Ŋuti Diploma hã, si wòxɔ tso Senyawo Gbɔkpɔ ƒe, si hã le Kampala.",
        "Lovia Boateng hã nye Nyɔnuwo le Suku kɔkɔwo me (WITE) Habɔbɔ, si tsɔ eɖokui na be yeado alɔ nyɔnuwo le sukudede me kple woƒe numekuku, ƒome, kple dɔwɔwɔ ƒe mɔzɔzɔwo.Eƒe ŋutega le hehenana kple asitsatsa si axɔ amewo katã ɖe eme, si ana mɔ̃ɖaŋununya nawɔ dɔ nyuie, eye wòanɔ te ɖe agbenyuinɔnɔ dzi la yi edzi le ɖoɖowo trɔm, de dzo sukuviwo me, eye wòle ŋusẽ dom nuto siwo le Ghana katã kple egodo.",
        "Kemi Adeosun dze eƒe dɔ gɔme abe akɔntabubu ƒe kpeɖeŋutɔ le British Telecom, London, tso ƒe 1989 vaseɖe ƒe 1990, emegbe eʋu yi Goodman Jones, London, eye wòwɔ dɔ abe agbalẽdzikpɔlagã ene tso ƒe 1990 va ɖo ƒe 1993. Emegbe Kemi va zu Internal Audit ƒe dɔdzikpɔla le London Underground, London kple Prism Consulting tso ƒe 1994 vaseɖe ƒe 2000 hafi va ge ɖe PricewaterhouseCoopers, London abe Senior Manager ene tso ƒe 2000 vaseɖe ƒe 2002. Le ƒe 2002 me la, Eva zu ganyawo dzikpɔla le Chapel Hill Denham Management eye emegbe, eva zu dɔdzikpɔla le ƒe 2010 me. Esi wòwɔ dɔ kple Quo Vadis Partnership abe dɔdzikpɔlagã tso ƒe 2010 va ɖo ƒe 2011 megbe la, emegbe woɖoe Ogun State ƒe Ganyawo Gbɔkpɔla le ƒe 2011 me. Kemi lé dɔ sia me ɖe asi tso ƒe 2011 va ɖo ƒe 2015. Enye Dukplɔla Ibikunle Amosun ƒe Dɔdasi si nye Tutuɖoɖo ƒe akpa vevi aɖe, si trɔ dukɔa ƒe ganyawo ƒe kesinɔnuwo.",
        "Member, Academic Advisory Board, Institute of Petroleum Studies (IPS)",
        "Sweet Adjeley, si wogayɔna be Marklina Naa Adjeley Quaye, nye Ghana Amerikatɔ nuɖala, nuɖuɖu vlogger, kple dijitaal nyatakakawo wɔla si wonya be ewɔa nuɖaɖa ŋuti nufiamewo eye wònaa nuɖaɖa ƒe hack siwo ŋu viɖe le. Wodea bubu Sweet Adjeley ŋu be enye Ghanatɔwo ƒe nuɖuɖu ŋuti nyatakakaŋlɔla gbãtɔ si ɖo ame miliɔn 1 kple edzivɔ siwo ŋlɔ ŋkɔ ɖe YouTube kple Facebook dzi.",
        "D’Almeida Adamon dze senyala ƒe dɔwɔwɔ gɔme le Paris le ƒe 1977. Etrɔ yi Cotonou le ƒe si kplɔe ɖo me. Enye senyawo ŋuti nufialagã le Benin Dukɔa ƒe Yunivɛsiti eye wonyae le nyɔnuwo ƒe gomenɔamesiwo taʋiʋli ta.",
        "Highlife va xɔ ŋkɔ eye ha sia kaka ɖe Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika nutowo katã me. Mɔɖelawo abe Cardinal Rex Lawson, E.T. Mensah, Victor Uwaifo, kple wo dometɔ ɖesiaɖe wɔ ha sia wòde blibo to Afrika-ʋuƒoƒowo kple ɣetoɖoƒe \"Native Blues\" zazã me. Le Xexemeʋa Evelia megbe la, haƒoƒo sia va xɔ ŋkɔ le Nigeria Igbowo dome, esi woxɔ ŋusẽ le wo si be woatu Igbo highlife si va zu woƒe dukɔa ƒe haƒoƒo si xɔ ŋkɔ wu le ƒe 1960-awo me.",
        "Wodzi Amarfio le Anyɔnyɔ 22, 1938 le Asere le Accra. Edze ʋuƒoƒo gɔme esime wòxɔ ƒe 14, eya ŋutɔe srɔ̃e, eye wòxɔ megbeŋkɔ si nye \"The Rhythm Man\" esime wòƒo ha le haƒoha geɖe me le Ghana vɔ la, le ƒe 1960 me la, eʋu yi London, afisi wòƒo ha kple Ghanatɔ hadzila bubuwo le, siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye nɔviŋutsu Teddy Osei (saxophone) kple Mac Tontoh (trumpet). Ewɔ ɖeka kple Afrika kple Caribbean hadzila bubuwo ɖo ƒuƒoƒo si nye Osibisa le ƒe 1969. Woƒo Ɣetoɖoƒetɔwo kple Afrikatɔwo ƒe haƒoƒo tsaka. Amarfio ŋlɔ ha geɖewo eye wòƒo ha le haƒoha geɖe siwo deŋgɔ, si dometɔ aɖewoe nye Netherlands (Dutch Top 40) kple United Kingdom. Amarfio do le ƒuƒoƒoa me le ƒe 1990 eye wòtrɔ yi Accra emegbe afisi woxoe abe hadzila kalẽtɔ. Le 22 Anyɔnyɔ, 2018 dzi la, hadzila geɖewo ƒo ha wɔ atsa be woatsɔ aɖu eƒe dzigbezã 80 lia.",
        "Kaka ƒe 1990 ƒeawo nawu enu la, nutalawo ƒe dzidzime yeye aɖe to haƒoƒo ƒomevi yeye aɖe vɛ si woyɔna be Hiplife. Atsyã sia wɔla enye Reggie Rockstone, Ghanatɔ hadzila si ƒo eɖokui ɖe hip-hop me le United States hafi va ke ɖe eƒe atsyã tɔxɛa ŋu. Hiplife koŋ nye hiphop le Ghanatɔwo ƒe nutoa me gbetagbe si wotsaka kple High-life si wozãna tsã ƒe akpa aɖewo. Ace hadzidzi wɔla Hammer of The Last Two me ɖe nutala siwo dometɔ aɖewoe nye Obrafour, Tinny kple Ex-doe siwo gade Hiplife hadzidzi ƒomevi si xɔ ŋkɔ ɖe edzi la ɖe go. Hiplife dzi ɖe edzi tso ɣemaɣi eye wòdzi ɣletiviwo abe Reggie Rockstone, Sherifa Gunu, Ayigbe Edem, Samini kple Sarkodie . Nuwɔla siwo ƒe agbanɔamedzie wònye be woakplɔ haƒoƒo ƒomevi sia ayi alesi wòle egbea gbɔe nye Hammer of The Last Two, Ball J, EL kple Jupitar Dancehall Artiste.",
        "ט uʄonu si le abe hourglass ʄe dzedzeme ene tso Ɣetoɖoƒe Afrika, si woate ŋu azã abe nuƒoƒo ƒomevi aɖe ene to ɖoɖowɔwɔ ɖe eƒe gbeɖiɖi kple ɣeyiɣi ƒe didime ŋu be woasrɔ̃ amegbetɔ ƒe nuƒoƒo ƒe gbeɖiɖi kple eƒe nyonyome me. ʋuta evee le esi esiwo wotsɔ lãgbalẽ siwo wotsɔ ka blaa enu te ɖe wonɔewo ŋue. Zi geɖe la, woʄonԑ esime wolée ɖe axatome. ʋuaʄola ate ŋu atrɔ ʋua ʄe gbeɖiɖime to ka siwo le ʋua ŋu to abɔ ɖeɖe le eŋu vie alo emamia ɖe eŋu vie me."
    ]
}
